    "description": "Deep Drop & Offshore Fishing Charter – Florida Keys is a locally operated experience in Cudjoe Key. Deep Drop Swordfish – The Ultimate Florida Keys Fishing Adventure. Fish with Captain Jose Rodriguez, a proven swordfish specialist in the Florida Keys, known for putting clients on fish when conditions get tough. This is not a casual trip—this is a true offshore hunt targeting one of the most sought-after species in the ocean. The operator lists the duration as 8 –10 Hour Options.",
