    "description": "Matanuska Glacier Hike & Tour – Winter Edition is a locally operated experience in Anchorage. Truly the most popular - Winter is so breath taking! Embark on an unforgettable winter adventure with the Matanuska Glacier Hike & Tour, where guests can explore one of Alaska’s most iconic glaciers. This winter edition allows you to witness the glacier’s awe-inspiring beauty covered in snow and ice, offering a unique perspective of Matanuska Glacier during the colder months.",
