    "description": "Bike and Tram Girdwood is a locally operated experience in Anchorage. Ages 12+ · Enjoy views from the Alyeska Tram · Call to book! Ride the Alyeska Resort Tram! Price Adults (Ages 16+) - Children (Ages 12-15) - minimum of 2 people / maximum 6 people Duration 7 Hours Tours leave at 9 AM About Explore outside of Anchorage and be a local for a day!",
