    "description": "Beginning Singletrack Mountain Biking Clinic is a locally operated experience in Anchorage. Must be comfortable riding on dirt paths, climbing, and descending dirt ski trails. About This two-week course begins with the core fundamentals of mountain biking. Topics include bike-body separation, climbing positions, braking, descending positions, cornering, front and rear wheel lifts, ratcheting, and balance techniques.",
