    "description": "3-Day Wildlife Adventure is a locally operated experience in Wrangell. Call to Book! · For all ages! · 3-Day Tour. The guest's destination is Wrangell, Alaska nestled in the famous Inside Passage. This package included world-class wildlife viewing in the real Alaskan wilderness, comfortable accommodations, and great lunches.",
