  "/destinations/united-states/alaska/juneau/tours/matanuska-glacier-with-guide-from-anchorage-391823": {
    "description": "Matanuska Glacier with Guide (from Anchorage) is a locally operated experience in Juneau. Alaska's largest glacier accessible by car is located just outside Anchorage, so. Departure Time - 8AM, most days Duration - 8 Hour excursion What's Included - Excursion in a 6 - 20 passenger vehicle - Tour guide & narration - Professional guide/certified Glaciologist - Usage & entry fees for Matanuska Glacier - 2 to 3 hours on the Matanuska Glacier - Crampons (for walking on ice) - Helmet - Trekking pole (optional) - Light snacks and bottled water Transportation Options - Pickup available at most hotels in Anchorage Minimum Booking - 4 required for tour to operate; the operator will work with vendor to honor all reservations or offer dates when it will be available. Guest/Participant Limitations - Must be able to hike 2+ miles without assistance - Must be able to walk in slippery & wet conditions ADA Access - This excursion is not ADA accessible due to the nature of walking on and around the glacier.",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BLNBnb0yTouCU0kcQNxX",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/NMOnPrxMTTSGfQxH8i67",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/apAz0smT8OXtuEEMPUz5",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rkmD8XLhQWa6RWfFHAjJ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BwmYrHWBRMCzqvBRQAGE",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/DR2RdwR5Sjm0Pwyw7Bh8",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qsbqk7svTbe16PFSZFzP",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/hvRq2ig0QOmsLDQxCm6i"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Alaska's largest glacier accessible by car is located just outside Anchorage, so",
      "ATD C-level: 10 Experience one of the largest glaciers near Anchorage…by hiking it",
      "This Anchorage tour is the guest's chance to walk on a glacier in the majestic Matanuska Valley–the experience of a lifetime",
      "Embark on a day trip from Anchorage to Matanuska Glacier",
      "The operator's certified guide provides instructions and gear, as well as information about the glacier and surrounding areas"
    ]
  },
  "/destinations/alaska/skagway/tours/glacier-point-wilderness-safari-393719": {
    "description": "Glacier Point Wilderness Safari is a locally operated experience in Skagway. Guests explore the Taiyia Inlet, Chilkat Inlet, and Chilkoot Inlet on this one-of-a-kind excursion. On this spellbinding wilderness expedition, guests can travel through fjords and rain forests viewing some of the most spectacular Alaskan scenery in Southeast Departure Time - Varies Duration - 6 hours (includes transfers) What's Included - Boat transportation to Davidson Glacier - Shuttle to base camp - guided canoe trip below Davidson Glacier - 1/4 mile hike in the Chilkat Mountains & rainforest - picnic lunch & beverages - Life preserver, foot gear, and other safety equipment Transportation Options - Pickup located at cruise ship docks & also downtown Skagway Guest/Participant Limitations - Must be able to walk on own (at least 100 yards). - Must be able to raise knee at least 12 inches - Weight limit of 350 pounds - Must be in good physical condition, ability to walk at least 1/2 mile on natural terrain.",
    "headline": "Explore the Taiyia Inlet, Chilkat Inlet, and Chilkoot Inlet on this one-of-a-kind excursion",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/zCbpwztTr6PMg7b4nCjg",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BLNBnb0yTouCU0kcQNxX",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/niNilJ2GR12NaWpdgDaA",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/uWyUXYTHRx9Oj2BhO9d9",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kDvJqd6ZRkGgJNN8IdXx",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/xVJfOHoROqsGNczLvMJJ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OvvqzsplTf6JpTJ92cPf",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/NMZmB1lRQkS5ggg6sBxe"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "ADA Access - This excursion is not able to accommodate guests with service animals or mobility assistive devices/wheelchairs",
      "The guest's adventure begins aboard one of the operator's boats custom-designed to provide an intimate viewing experience",
      "After a ¼ mile walk, the forest opens to reveal a breathtaking view of the Davidson Glacier and pristine lake below",
      "Conditions permitting, guests can make a stop on the delta to get up close and personal with the glacier",
      "This is an optional 1/2 to 1-mile hike over a sand and pebble beach"
    ]
  },
