  "/destinations/florida/temple-terrace/tours/11a--pearl-harbor-dole-plantation-and-polynesian-cultural-center-tour-departing-from-waikiki-area-316505": {
    "description": "11A- Pearl Harbor, Dole Plantation, and Polynesian Cultural Center Tour Departing from Waikiki Area is a locally operated experience in Temple Terrace. Runs Daily (except Wed. & Sun.) @ 7:00AM · Pick-up 6:00AM - 7:00AM · Duration 10 Hrs. Oahu’s Ultimate Adventure: History, Culture, and Scenic Beauty in One Unforgettable Tour Embark on a memorable journey through Oahu’s most iconic destinations, starting at the Pearl Harbor Historic Sites Visitor Center, where history comes to life. Guests discover fascinating exhibits detailing the events leading up to the fateful attack on December 7, 1941.",
    "headline": "Runs Daily (except Wed. & Sun.) @ 7:00AM  ·  Pick-up 6:00AM - 7:00AM  ·  Duration 10 Hrs",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WSCdnGtESumZdES2TYBJ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6jrjbjAbRxCxqNMgeRQ4",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0LaZpGmzTMyNkSbfo2ZA"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Guests discover fascinating exhibits detailing the events leading up to the fateful attack on December 7, 1941",
      "Next, the tour heads to the Dole Plantation, a paradise for pineapple lovers",
      "Savor the famous Dole Whip, stroll through the charming grounds, and explore a variety of pineapple-inspired treats and souvenirs",
      "Arriving at the Polynesian Cultural Center, guests will be immersed in the vibrant cultures of the Pacific Islands",
      "See traditional performances, learn about ancient customs, and get a taste of Polynesian life through art, music, and dance demonstrations"
    ]
  },
