    "meetingPoint": "You can wait by our lobby and when check-in begins a side gate will be opened. Staff with clipboards will be there to check you in 10 minutes prior to start time. Once checked in, parents are free to leave and campers will be directed to their class table to place down their items and get their nametag. Once check-in has finished the class Instructor will assemble all the campers to go over expectations, the schedule of the day, and begin!",
