    "description": "Barcelona Street Photo Tour is a locally operated experience in Paris. Private Tour · 3 hours · Explore the hidden street of La Rambla. Guests explore the hidden streets of the La Rambla, or take a stroll along with Gaudì masterpieces a spectacular photo tour of Barcelona. Rates First Person (Ages 18+): €200 Additional Guest (Ages 12+): €50 Duration 3 hours About A three-hour private photo tour in Barcelona.",
