    "description": "Walking tour in Portofino and Pesto Course in Rapallo is a locally operated experience in Manarola. Up to 8 people · 4 hours. Duration 4 hours About In the morning (around 9 am), guests can be picked up from the hotel by a private car or minivan and transferred to Portofino where you meet the guest's professional English-speaking tour guide and start the day with a guided visit of this beautiful village considered the pearl of the Tigullio’s area and, also, a popular VIP location. It has colorfully painted fisherman's houses at the harbor, which have been transformed in elegant boutiques and bars.",
