  "/destinations/italy/manarola/tours/night-hiking-from-corniglia-to-manarola--private-experience-166574": {
    "description": "Night hiking: from Corniglia to Manarola- Private experience is a locally operated experience in Manarola. Duration 3,5 hours About Meet the guest's hiking guide in the evening before sunset in the village of Corniglia. Start the guest's walk uphill in the forest above Corniglia with the last light of the day, night will fall quickly and soon guests can see the light of the full moon illuminating the guest's steps. After about 1,5 hours hiking time guests can reach the vineyards of Volastra, spectacularly located overlooking the sea and the villages of Corniglia and Manarola.",
    "headline": "3,5 hours",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/uHETn5NQUuu2cPtZ0pLw",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/aBaH1HG4Rpqryro8XgmX",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/tUs0su4kRcFcZrjZqaoK"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Duration 3,5 hours About Meet the guest's hiking guide in the evening before sunset in the village of Corniglia",
      "The narrow path meanders over the terraced fields amidst the vines and it's an incredible experience doing this hike under the full moon",
      "After this break it's only a short walk to the little village of Volastra where you have the option to catch a bus to reach Manarola or go on by foot",
      "In Spring and in Fall the ground could be slippery and the trekking restricted to the village of Manarola"
    ]
  },
