    "description": "Alcatraz & Streets of San Francisco Tour is a locally operated experience in San Francisco. 2 Days: Alcatraz Ticket + San Francisco Guided E-Bike Tour. Alcatraz tour on the guest's booked date; Bike tour the next day at 11:00 AM! Duration Alcatraz Tour 2 to 3 hours Bike Tour 3 to 4 hours (Next day at 11 AM) This tour is for age 13 & up Beginner to Novice Activity details Experience two of San Francisco’s most iconic adventures with this 2-day Alcatraz and citywide e-bike tour package.",
