      "The River Spey is 107 miles long and one of Scotland’s classic whitewater trips",
      "Our 60 mile canoe paddle will take us downstream through the iconic towns of Aviemore, Grantown-upon-Spey and Charlestown of Aberlour",
      "The River Spey may be famous for malt whisky and salmon fishing, but it also has some fantastic views of both the landscape and the wildlife",
