  "/destinations/montana/kalispell/tours/mastercraft-surf-boat-676786": {
    "description": "MasterCraft Surf Boat is a locally operated experience in Kalispell. Surf Flathead Lake with the operator's MasterCraft XT21 — Gear, Lessons @ Marina Cay Resort. Expect an unforgettable day on Flathead Lake aboard the operator's MasterCraft XT21 — the ultimate wake surf and wakeboard experience. Whether you're a first-time surfer or a seasoned rider, guests can enjoy a clean, powerful wave, premium gear, and a smooth, comfortable ride. The operator lists the duration as 4 Hours - 7 Days.",
    "headline": "Surf Flathead Lake with our MasterCraft XT21 — Gear, Lessons @ Marina Cay Resort",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5VnrykPzRpuDdOkvvKB0",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/mRV77aQpRjiQOMy5gwCp"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Coast Guard–approved vests for all guests on board. 🧺 Fresh Towels – Clean towels provided for every guest to dry off after your session.",
      "Expect an unforgettable day on Flathead Lake aboard the operator's MasterCraft XT21 — the ultimate wake surf and wakeboard experience",
      "Whether you're a first-time surfer or a seasoned rider, guests can enjoy a clean, powerful wave, premium gear, and a smooth, comfortable ride",
      "Choose a guided surf lesson with the operator's professional instructor or relax while the guest's personal driver handles the boat",
      "Launch directly from Marina Cay Resort with no towing or setup required — just show up, hop aboard, and make memories on the water"
    ],
    "duration": "4 Hours - 7 Days",
    "meetingPoint": "Check-In Details 📍 Please arrive 10 minutes early to meet your driver or instructor at Marina Cay Resort, located at 180 Vista Lane, Bigfork, MT. 🚤 Head straight to the dock — your red MasterCraft XT21 will be waiting in Slip M12, with your driver or instructor there ready to greet you. 🌊 Check in right at the boat, hop aboard, and get ready for an unforgettable day on Flathead Lake!",
    "included": [
      "Coast Guard–approved vests for all guests on board. 🧺 Fresh Towels – Clean towels provided for every guest to dry off after your session."
    ]
  },
