    "meetingPoint": "We don't have a retail location. We meet our guests at the Kuhio Beach Hula Mound. AKA: Kuhio Beach Park. Address located at 2451 Kalakaua Ave, Honolulu, Hawaii 96815. There is a huge Banyan tree with a cutout for cars to pick up and drop off people."
