    "highlights": [
      "Expect call-and-response narration, atmospheric cues, and a quietly eerie vibe—more candlelit folklore than jump scares",
      "Settle into indoor lounge seating or step onto the open decks for sweeping skyline views",
      "This is a narrated harbor cruise (we don’t land on the islands); sights vary with weather and navigation"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "##Meeting Location * 60 Rowes Wharf (Boston, MA) - Upon arrival to our location please check-in with our ticket representative inside the ferry terminal to receive boarding passes. * (Exact meeting location details will be provided immediately upon purchase of tickets.)",
