    "description": "The Cultural River Expedition is a locally operated experience in Retaruke. 3 Days & 2 Nights Guided and Catered Whanganui River Journey from Whakahoro to Pipiriki. 🌊✨ Experience the Spirit of the Whanganui Awa (River) on a 3-Day Guided River Journey with Owhango Adventures! ✨🌊 Imagine gliding down the majestic Whanganui River, surrounded by breathtaking landscapes and the rich tapestry of Māori culture. The operator lists the duration as 3 Days + 2 Nights.",
