    "description": "Mammoth Cave Expedition is a locally operated experience in Mountain Ranch. Ages 8+ · Reservations Required · 2-3 Hours. Duration 2-3 Hours About This 2-3 hour trip takes the beginning explorer through the historic Mammoth Cave area as far back as the beautiful Jungle Room. Spelunkers will crawl, wiggle and squirm their way through natural passages connecting eight different chambers.",
