    "description": "Middle Earth Cave Expedition is a locally operated experience in Mountain Ranch. Ages 16+ · Seasonal · Reservations Required · 3-4 Hours. Let the underground wonders of the operator's cave system amaze you! Duration Trip time varies depending on the number of participants, 3-4 hours About Dive into the heart of the Earth with the operator's exhilarating spelunking tours, where guests can discover the hidden wonders of the operator's magnificent cave system.",
