    "description": "Group Reservations is a locally operated experience in Mountain Ranch. Call to Book! · Bring the guest's school/organization to California Cavern. About California Cavern is a great location for field trips, church, work outings, scouting trips and more! Discounts are available for organized group trips with at least a week's notice.",
