    "description": "ZIPLINES & MONKEYLAND is a locally operated experience in Sheridan. Connect with Nature and Wild Friends. This activity consists of 12 Zip Lines, the longest one being 800 meters long! In fact this adventure includes the 2 longest lines in the Dominican Republic.",
