    "description": "Introduction to Alpine Climbing Skills is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 4 People · 8 Hours · Learn Basic Alpine Rock Techniques! If you don't have a lot of previous backcountry experience or only have rock or ice climbing experience course participants will learn: - Basic backcountry navigation and travel skills. - Backpacking and backcountry camping skills like site selection and water treatment in alpine areas.",
    "headline": "Ages 8+  ·  Up to 4 People  ·  8 Hours  ·  Learn Basic Alpine Rock Techniques!",
