    "description": "Introduction to Snow Climbing Skills is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 4 People · 8 Hours · Learn Basic Snow Climbing Techniques! If you’ve only ever been hiker or a peak trekker this is the next step in being able to access new terrain. During this Intro to Snow Climbing course participants will learn: - Basic use of crampons and footwork.",
