    "description": "Intro to Ice Climbing is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Private Group · Up to 8 People · 8 Hours. If you’ve never climbed ice or even rock climbed before this is the place to start. During this Intro to Ice Climbing course participants will learn: - How to provide a solid lead and toprope belay that makes you a sought after climbing partner.",
