    "description": "Steep Ice and Mixed Technique is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Private Group · Up to 8 People · 4 Hours. If you have only just started climbing ice but feel like you've hit a plateau or want to learn specific techniques for mixed climbing here are some skills guests can learn: - Techniques for keeping the guest's energy on long, steep sections of ice. - Techniques for mixed routes where you need to climb on ice and rock in a pitch.",
