    "description": "Learn to Lead Ice is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Private Group · Up to 8 People · 8 Hours. If you are an experienced ice climber who is confident in the guest's technique here is what guests can expect to learn during this ice climbing course: - The proper way to stage the guest's belayer and provide a solid lead belay yourself.. - How to place ice screws based on the ice quality.",
