    "description": "Multipitch and Backcountry Ice is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Private Group · Up to 8 People · 8 Hours. If you are an experienced ice climber who is confident in the guest's technique and ability to lead here is what guests can expect to learn during this ice climbing course: - Anchor building and station management. - Avalanche assessment as it relates to backcountry ice climbs and descents.",
