    "description": "Learn to Lead Sport Climb Outdoors is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 8 People · 8 Hours. Climbers who want to move beyond toproping or may have lead indoors but realize it’s much different outdoors will gain some important knowledge during a sport leading class. In addition to clipping bolts outside participants will learn: - How to provide a solid lead belay that makes you a sought after climbing partner.",
