    "description": "Learn to Lead Traditional Climbs is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 8 People · 8 Hours. Climbers who want to climb in some of the most amazing places in Colorado like Eldorado Canyon or Unaweep Canyon should think of this course as the basis for starting in those places. During this Trad Leading course participants will learn: - How to provide a solid lead belay that makes you a sought after climbing partner.",
