  "/destinations/colorado/colorado-springs/tours/gunnison-full-day-climb-626883": {
    "description": "Gunnison Full Day Climb is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 12 People · 8 Hours. Gunnison is a pleasant mountain town near the San Juans. While there is fewer options with shorter days once you add in the longer days there are a variety of climbing areas to enjoy.",
    "headline": "Ages 8+  ·  Up to 12 People  ·  8 Hours",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/iJAslkWRnaKxvqjvyRfx"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Gunnison is a pleasant mountain town near the San Juans",
      "While there is fewer options with shorter days once you add in the longer days there are a variety of climbing areas to enjoy",
      "- Black Canyon of the Gunnison NP: while it's name might suggest it's near the town it's actually near the river for which the town is named",
      "It's still a couple hours away"
    ]
  },
  "/destinations/colorado/colorado-springs/tours/black-canyon-np-classic-climbs-626888": {
    "description": "Black Canyon NP Classic Climbs is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 2 People · 8-12 Hours. The Black Canyon has a reputation. It's imposing and the deep, dark canyon can make you question whether you have what it takes to escape.",
    "headline": "Ages 8+  ·  Up to 2 People  ·  8-12 Hours",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WQoYSnraRtmEaME2WEEG"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "The Black Canyon has a reputation",
      "It's imposing and the deep, dark canyon can make you question whether you have what it takes to escape",
      "The climbs are stellar though and a variety of them have great moves on some of the biggest rock walls in the whole state",
      "Choose between these classic climbs - Maiden Voyage (5",
      "9): a stellar 6 pitch climb that can be combined with King Me if you're feeling like you need a bit more challenge"
    ]
  },
  "/destinations/colorado/colorado-springs/tours/san-juan-half-day-climb-626895": {
    "description": "San Juan Half Day Climb is a locally operated experience in Colorado Springs. Ages 8+ · Up to 12 People · 4 Hours. The San Juan Mountains are home to some of the most rugged terrain in Colorado. While there is climbing almost everywhere the operator offers up crags in the alpine valleys where these mountain communities are found.",
    "headline": "Ages 8+  ·  Up to 12 People  ·  4 Hours",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/bFFU6IQGTKWVIZEZ43fy"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "The San Juan Mountains are home to some of the most rugged terrain in Colorado",
      "While there is climbing almost everywhere the operator offers up crags in the alpine valleys where these mountain communities are found",
      "- Silverton: is an isolated town pretty much right in the middle of the San Juans",
      "While primarily known for the big ice climbs we guide in the winter there are some nice crags to enjoy when you need to beat the heat",
      "- Ouray: although limited to a small portion of a wall if you happen to find yourself here we're happy to show you around"
    ]
  },
