  "/destinations/australia/ocean-shores/tours/gidjuum-gulganyi-walk---pack-free-617872": {
    "description": "Gidjuum Gulganyi Walk - Pack Free is a locally operated experience in Ocean Shores. The Gidjuum Gulganyi Walk - “The Old Peoples Track” · 4 days, 3 nights · Max 10 guests. Take advantage of walking the amazing Gidjuum Gulganyi Walk carrying just a daypack with the luxury of having the guest's gear transported between campsites. Our 4-day 3-night walk along the Gidjuum Gulganyi Track (Old People's Track) takes us through the traditional lands of the Widjabul Wia-bal and Minjumgbal people of the Bundjalung Nation. The operator lists the duration as 4 days - 3 nights.",
    "headline": "The Gidjuum Gulganyi Walk - “The Old Peoples Track”  ·  4 days, 3 nights  ·  Max 10 guests",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/XMpAqfm0RFWc8C8JeuKL"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Safety Gear -All safety gear including satellite communication and first aid kits including an AED. All Group Gear - All group gear: cooking and eating, tents and sleeping mats",
      "Group bookings of 10 guests receive a 10% discount"
    ],
    "duration": "4 days - 3 nights",
    "included": [
      "Safety Gear -All safety gear including satellite communication and first aid kits including an AED. All Group Gear - All group gear: cooking and eating, tents and sleeping mats"
    ]
  },
  "/destinations/australia/ocean-shores/tours/yuraygir-coastal-walk---pack-free-617877": {
    "description": "Yuraygir Coastal Walk - Pack Free is a locally operated experience in Ocean Shores. Follow the Coastal Emu footprints along the Clarence Coast · 5 days, 4 nights · Max 10 guests. Take advantage of walking this amazing coastal walk through the traditional lands of the Yaegl and Gumbaynggirr people begins at the iconic surfing village of Angourie, just south of Yamba. We follow the coastline and the Yuraygir National Park for 5 days of hiking on unspoiled and pristine beaches and coastal tracks void of anyone else. The operator lists the duration as 5 days - 4 nights.",
    "headline": "Follow the Coastal Emu footprints along the Clarence Coast  ·  5 days, 4 nights  ·  Max 10 guests",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kRzfKGu0RhWmmB4JIxfI"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "We follow the coastline and the Yuraygir National Park for 5 days of hiking on unspoiled and pristine beaches and coastal tracks void of anyone else",
      "Group booking of 10 guests receive a 10% discount"
    ],
    "duration": "5 days - 4 nights"
  },
  "/destinations/australia/ocean-shores/tours/private-walking-tour-617879": {
    "description": "Private Walking Tour is a locally operated experience in Ocean Shores. Private multi day hikes · Max 10. Embark on a private, customizable tour exploring some of Australia's most stunning coastal landscapes and rich cultural heritage. Choose from the 4-day, 3-night Gidjuum Gulganyi Track (Old Peoples Track) through the traditional lands of the Widjabul Wia-bal and Minjumgbal people, where guests can experience a scenic journey while having the guest's gear transported between campsites. The operator lists the duration as 5 days - 4 nights or 4 days - 3 nights.",
    "headline": "Private multi day hikes  ·  Max 10",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/j52DT4tZQMWewYdLfjtE"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Safety Gear -All safety gear including satellite communication and first aid kits including an AED. All Group Gear - All group gear: cooking and eating, tents and sleeping mats",
      "Embark on a private, customizable tour exploring some of Australia's most stunning coastal landscapes and rich cultural heritage",
      "Both walks are perfect for those seeking a tranquil adventure in a truly remote and beautiful part of the world"
    ],
    "duration": "5 days - 4 nights or 4 days - 3 nights",
    "included": [
      "Safety Gear -All safety gear including satellite communication and first aid kits including an AED. All Group Gear - All group gear: cooking and eating, tents and sleeping mats"
    ]
  },
