    "description": "RiverQuest Sunset Tree Swallow Cruise is a locally operated experience in Essex. Late August - September · 2+ Hours · Ages 10+. Rates Passenger (Ages 10+): Duration 2+ Hours About Join us aboard RiverQuest as we cruise a special spot on the Connecticut River where 100’s of thousands of Tree Swallows gather. After spending the day miles away, the swallows return each night to sleep in the reeds.",
