    "description": "Express Trail Ride is a locally operated experience in Custer. 30 min · Ages 5+ · Beginner-friendly, Max 8 guests. Lame Johnny Hideaway Trail For those short on time but still wanting to experience the beauty of the French Creek Nature Area, our 30-minute Express Ride is the perfect option. Ideal for novices, young riders, or anyone looking for a quick adventure, this ride offers a taste of the stunning landscapes and peaceful surroundings that make the operator's longer rides so popular.",
