  "/destinations/qubec/qubec/tours/heritage-and-upper-town-630635": {
    "description": "Heritage & Upper Town is a locally operated experience in Qubec. This is an ideal tour to discover the charms and beauty of Old Quebec Upper Town! The guest's guide will take you to historical sites, pointing out the wide variety of architectural style inside the fortified walls. Stop at the main attractions such as the amazing Cathedral-Basilica of Notre-Dame, the courtyard Old Seminary of Quebec and the imposing City Hall and garden.",
    "headline": "For up to 8 people!  ·  3 hours  ·  Heritage & Upper Town!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HJNEvS2rSISjjWeCJTzc"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "This is an ideal tour to discover the charms and beauty of Old Quebec Upper Town",
      "The guest's guide will take you to historical sites, pointing out the wide variety of architectural style inside the fortified walls",
      "While venturing outside the only remaining city walls north of Mexico, the tour will lead you in front of the noble Parliament Hill",
      "From there, enter the impressive National Battlefields Park, known as the “Plains of Abraham’’, with its rich cultural heritage and enchanting park",
      "The experience includes pedaling in tree-lined covered streets of Montcalm’s vibrant neighborhood with a touch of urban artist lifestyle"
    ]
  },
