  "/destinations/qubec/qubec/tours/beyond-the-walls-630644": {
    "description": "Beyond the Walls is a locally operated experience in Qubec. Combining two tours, the prestigious Upper Town & the trendy neighborhoods, of the Lower Town and with all the main attractions plus hidden gems all in one tour! At the guest's own pace, explore some of the most stylish neighborhoods of Quebec City. What a lovely way of beginning the guest's tour inside the historical fortification walls with its wide variety of architectural and historical sites that dates far back as the 17th century.",
    "headline": "For up to 8 people!  ·  5 hours  ·  Beyond the Walls!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ayTHpbeSBCwGraHgTG01"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "At the guest's own pace, explore some of the most stylish neighborhoods of Quebec City",
      "The experience includes pedaling in tree-lined covered streets of Montcalm, a vibrant neighborhood with a touch of cultural lifestyle",
      "Ride down the winding secret passage trail to reach the bike path that joins the banks of the majestic Saint Lawrence River",
      "Guests discover an artistic neighborhood with its unique colorful spiral staircases and whilst hearing fascinating stories of Limoilou",
      "What an amazing chance to mingle with local Quebecois at the “Grand Marché”, sample local delights and meet local producers"
    ]
  },
