    "description": "4-Day Azores Tour | Island Adventure & Nature Highlights is a locally operated experience in Ponta Delgada. Four-day guided tour of São Miguel, Azores, featuring volcanic lakes, geothermal sites, tea plantation, and 4-star accommodation. Guests explore São Miguel over four days and three nights, staying in 4-star accommodation while visiting the island’s standout natural and cultural sites. Highlights include Furnas’ geothermal fields and traditional Cozido lunch, the botanical splendour of Terra Nostra Park, panoramic viewpoints over Sete Cidades, Lagoa do Fogo’s pristine crater lake and a visit to a local tea plantation with tasting. The operator lists the duration as 4 days 3 nights. Meeting details: Arrive at Ponta Delgada Airport (PDL); private transfer will meet you on arrival. Hotel check-in PM; early arrivals may leave luggage at reception. Return private transfer to PDL on day 4.",
