    "description": "Off-Road E-Bike Tour in The Buda Hills is a locally operated experience in Budapest. Age 14+ · 4.5h · Semi-Private · E-MTB Adventure 🇬🇧 · Explore the peaks of Budapest! Join the operator's e-bike adventure tour in Buda's hills to explore the top viewpoints including the highest lookout point of Budapest. The experience includes the best panoramic views and some great mountain bike trails.",
