  "/destinations/minnesota/sauk-rapids/tours/smash-room-594825": {
    "description": "Smash Room is a locally operated experience in Sauk Rapids. Ages 10+ · 55 Minutes · Up to 8 People. Smashers will put on protective gear (face shield & gloves) and connect to the operator's speaker (or use the operator's preferred rage soundtrack) and be given a box of breakables to smash (20–25 pieces, sanitized bottles and other glassware). Smashers will choose their tools (baseball bats, golf clubs, hammers) and smash stuff!",
    "headline": "Ages 10+  ·  55 Minutes  ·  Up to 8 People",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/v42ePExHQhqLs300qsVE"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes When you are finished with your experience, we will give you a jar with some of the remains of your smash experience as a memento.",
      "Smashers will choose their tools (baseball bats, golf clubs, hammers) and smash stuff",
      "Smashers must wear a long-sleeved shirt, long pants, and closed toe shoes (no sandals or crocs)",
      "Every experience is a private one, meaning guests can not share the guest's time with other groups"
    ],
    "included": [
      "When you are finished with your experience, we will give you a jar with some of the remains of your smash experience as a memento."
    ]
  },
