  "/destinations/minnesota/sauk-rapids/tours/splatter-painting-594839": {
    "description": "Splatter Painting is a locally operated experience in Sauk Rapids. For all ages! · 1 Hour · Up to 10 People. Participants will put on an apron and goggles and be given a canvas to create with! Guests can be able to connect to the operator's speaker (or we can provide a playlist) and be given 5 different colors of painting medium to work with.",
    "headline": "For all ages!  ·  1 Hour  ·  Up to 10 People",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/PZHycPpSScmOrd7PuQrd"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Participants will put on an apron and goggles and be given a canvas to create with",
      "Guests can be able to connect to the operator's speaker (or we can provide a playlist) and be given 5 different colors of painting medium to work with",
      "Guests can use different tools to throw the paint onto the canvas and be able to move the canvas through space to create a one-of-a-kind piece of art",
      "Guests can add glitter or confetti after you are done splattering",
      "Every experience is private (guests can not be sharing the space or the guest's time with anyone else)"
    ]
  },
