  "/destinations/united-states/minnesota/battle-lake/tours/bennington-o-602610": {
    "description": "Bennington O is a locally operated experience in Battle Lake. 1-14 Day Rental Options · Up to 10 Guests. 22ft Bennington (10-person capacity) pontoon with 50hp Yamaha 4stroke outboard motor, fish finder, and rear ladder. The operator lists the duration as 1-14 Day Rental Options.",
    "headline": "1-14 Day Rental Options  ·  Up to 10 Guests",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/p1stgqtMSEqu2P5Em1Om",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/efyxUDMQse4OskMj1Sqw",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YQrYftgMRlqke0brpluD",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/QBHEKazzS12IfwyioX7V",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/gJHduAGZQN2XUoCP1KEx"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "22ft Bennington (10-person capacity) pontoon with 50hp Yamaha 4stroke outboard motor, fish finder, and rear ladder"
    ],
    "duration": "1-14 Day Rental Options",
    "meetingPoint": "**AFTER BOOKING** please email a copy the following documents to office@enclavemarine.com: - **DRIVER'S LICENSE** - **HOMEOWNERS OR RENTERS INSURANCE DECLARATION PAGE** These **MUST** be on file with our office prior to the rental pontoon or boat leaving our lot. When your rental is delivered to a public lake access or picked up at our facility, a staff member will review a checklist with you. This checklist will cover the location of all onboard items and basic operation instructions. After the review, you'll be asked to sign and date the checklist. We’ll follow the same procedure when the rental is returned, whether at the public lake access point or dropped off at our facility. **RENTAL PRICING INCLUDES ONE FULL TANK OF FUEL.** Please let us know if you need additional fuel during your rental period. Any additional fuel would be fuel price plus a surcharge to deliver and refill at the public access (this will be charged to the card on file). If there is sufficient fuel for your rental period, **PLEASE DO NOT PUT ANY FUEL IN THE WATERCRAFT BEFORE RETURNING.**"
  },
