  "/destinations/florida/marco-island/tours/golden-hour-jet-ski-tour-a-thrilling-twilight-ride-620282": {
    "description": "Golden Hour Jet Ski Tour – A Thrilling Twilight Ride is a locally operated experience in Marco Island. 1 1/2 hours · Wildlife Sightings! · Drivers 16+. Guests experience the magic of golden hour on the water with the operator's Sunset Jet Ski Tour at Florida Adventures and Rentals! 5-hour, 20-mile adventure takes you through the breathtaking backwaters of the 10,000 Islands, where the sky transforms into a masterpiece of warm hues.",
    "headline": "1 1/2 hours  ·  Wildlife Sightings!  ·  Drivers 16+",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/bvYoQslsTQCChB1DqEny",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ggr7BmDWRneMAwYCoEPO",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/eaN5RQiTpyhvC5o9tX0y",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/U7sfh4A3SgKhgVvaiTYc",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/oQ756Hk2QOKUCYERZTwi"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Life jackets, dry bags, and gas for the jet ski!",
      "Guests experience the magic of golden hour on the water with the operator's Sunset Jet Ski Tour at Florida Adventures and Rentals",
      "Led by the operator's experienced U",
      "As the sun dips lower, watch the sky explode in brilliant shades of orange, pink, and gold, reflecting off the serene waterways",
      "Keep an eye out for playful dolphins, soaring ospreys, and other local wildlife coming alive in the evening light"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Guests are required to arrive 30 minutes ahead of their scheduled tour time. Guests are also required to bring a photo ID (drivers license, passport, etc) and boaters license/certificate (if applicable). Guests that are NOT driving but are passengers are still required to bring their photo ID, and boaters license/certificate (if applicable). Our booth for check in is located at the main building by the ship store entrance on the right. We are the only jet ski tour company present at the marina. DO NOT GO down to the docks for check in if no one is at the booth. Call the office if you have any trouble finding us. If you are late to check in or arrive without the required documentation, you will be subject to a one time reschedule or cancelled without refund. Tours depart ON TIME!",
    "included": [
      "Life jackets, dry bags, and gas for the jet ski!"
    ]
  },
