    "description": "Weekly Rentals is a locally operated experience in Marco Island. Rent Kayaks, Paddle Boards and Fishing Gear! Guests can have the kayak, Paddleboard or fishing poles delivered for free to the guest's home or condo here on Marco Island, Isle of Capri or Goodland. Guests can explore the canals and nearby waterways from the comfort of the guest's home or rental property.",
