    "description": "Offshore Fishing Charter is a locally operated experience in Santa Rosa Beach. All ages welcome · 5/6/8 hour options · Up to 6 Angles! On an offshore charter, guests can head out into the Gulf. Guests can fish in deeper waters where guests can have the chance to reel in larger and more prized species, including red snapper, vermilion snapper, lane snapper, grouper, amberjack, king mackerel, cobia, mahi-mahi (dorado), trigger fish, wahoo, and even blackfin tuna during the right season.",
