      "Upon arrival at Crab Island relax and play with water toys and floats at the guest's leisure",
      "The operator's captain and crew stay with you the entire time for a worry-free day",
      "Once at Crab Island, we’ll anchor, giving you plenty of time to swim, snorkel with the gear provided, or simply relax in the shallow waters",
      "If conditions are right, we may also venture out into the Gulf for more scenic views and wildlife encounters"
