    "description": "Key West Historic Bahama Village & Hemingway Heritage is a locally operated experience in Key West. Ever wondered how the island of Key West was discovered and became so rich? Guests explore Key West’s history, lore, and legends from the ground up with an intimate walking tour. Whether you want to learn more about the island’s first industries such as shipwrecking and cigarmaking, are curious about local history, or are looking for a fun-filled walk, Key West’s Historic Districts are waiting for you!",
