    "description": "Guided Sanctuary Tour is a locally operated experience in Tavernier. All Ages · 1hr · Tour Guide shares stories, history, and behind-the-scenes look in the operator's feed station! An in-depth, guided tour led by Team Wild Bird includes an educational walkthrough of the operator's sanctuary, highlighting the operator's organization’s history, sharing each non-releasable bird’s unique story, and a behind-the-scenes look at the operator's feed station. The tour wraps up with a nature talk and exploration where the operator's boardwalk ends and the Florida Bay begins.",
