    "description": "Savannah River Fossil Hunt is a locally operated experience in Tybee Island. Ages 6+ · 4 Hours · Up to 6 People. Duration 4 Hours About Come uncover the past as we beachcomb the dredge spoils along the Savannah River looking for shark teeth, whale bones and countless other types of fossils. We may find a variety of shark teeth including Bull, Dusky, Tiger, Sand Tiger, Mako, Great White and maybe even a massive Megalodon.",
