    "meetingPoint": "Meet at Navajo Loop Trailhead (near Sunset Point in Bryce Canyon National Park). Arrive at least 15 minutes before your tour start time. Parking at the trailhead is limited; if full, use the free park shuttle from the Visitor Center (runs every 8–10 minutes) which drops off at Sunset Point. Look for your guide near the Navajo Loop trail sign.",
