    "description": "Crystal River Three Sisters Springs Tour is a locally operated experience in Crystal River. A two-hour guided clear kayak tour through Kings Bay to Three Sisters Springs, with time to swim! Three Sisters Springs is one of the most photographed spring systems in Florida — turquoise, spring-fed, and 72° year-round. This tour paddles you across Kings Bay to it in a 100% clear kayak, with time to swim once we're there.",
