  "/destinations/colorado/woodland-park/tours/25-hour-guided-mountain-wildlife-jeep-tour-606867": {
    "description": "2.5 Hour Guided Mountain Wildlife Jeep Tour is a locally operated experience in Woodland Park. Woodland Park · Pay Per Person. Embark on an unforgettable adventure with Great Outdoors Adventures Jeep tour in the majestic Rocky Mountains of Colorado. Guests experience the thrill of a lifetime as you take the wheel of the guest's very own Jeep and traverse the breathtaking landscapes of Woodland Park, Colorado.",
    "headline": "Woodland Park ·  Pay Per Person",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6cwCwaTHSj2gqOUc8ei5",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fXhgtN4R9yAR2qrS1gzu",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/GaVDSTJpQLmHHqg32oYV",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/DQ37yGIkSv6duKpVwFzd",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/gQdLdh9HTyySWJYXgLSt",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1PqrXH93Q0C4J7Ir6FIc"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Plan to bring Ride prepared! Bring, rain gear, water, sunglasses if desired. Be aware of current temperatures and weather conditions.",
      "Embark on an unforgettable adventure with Great Outdoors Adventures Jeep tour in the majestic Rocky Mountains of Colorado",
      "Navigate rugged backcountry trails and rocky inclines under the expert guidance of seasoned tour leaders, who lead the way in a separate vehicle",
      "Feel the adrenaline rush as you immerse yourself in the exhilaration of off-road driving amidst the serene beauty of the Rockies",
      "Marvel at towering peaks and lush forests as the guest's tour takes you deep into the heart of the Rocky Mountains"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "## Check-In Please arrive 30 minutes early to allow time for check-in. ***************************************************************************************** ### Rental Agreement Complete your rental agreement/waiver the day before your ride. * Select the date of your booking * **Select the Jeep you'd like to drive** * List one driver and then additional participants * Authorized guardians will need to sign for minors at time of rental * All drivers must present a valid license at time of rental ### Rental Agreement & Waiver **[Complete your rental agreement BEFORE arriving. One PER driver, for each additional driver. ](https://waivers.poladv.com/GOAwoodlandpark)** ***************************************************************************************** See our [Frequently Asked Questions] (https://goadventures.org/faqs/) page for more information related to our policies and tips. ***Our staff will welcome you with a smile and provide great advice. They'll make sure your vehicles are clean before and after your ride. Please consider leaving a tip for our staff, or gratuity, to show your appreciation.*** See you soon! GOA Family"
  },
