    "description": "2 HR | The Ultimate San Diego Adventure: Gaslamp, Old Town & Balboa Park GoCar Tour is a locally operated experience in San Diego. Most Popular! · Must be 21+ to rent. This is THE essential San Diego tour. Guests can see many of the great places that make San Diego \"America's Finest City\".",
