    "description": "Big Creek: A Guided Paddle Through the Canadian Amazon is a locally operated experience in Port Rowan. Navigate the winding waters of the ‘Canadian Amazon’! Navigate the winding waters of the ‘Canadian Amazon’ with confidence. Deep in the Long Point Biosphere, the operator's certified guides handle the route so guests can focus on spotting eagles and otters in the ancient Carolinian Forest.",
