    "meetingPoint": "* **Meeting Location:** The landing parking lot at the bridge on Lakeshore Road in Port Royal (near 2717 Lakeshore Rd, Port Rowan). * **Restrooms:** There are **no facilities** at the launch or take-out. Please use the nearby Esso station or the public washrooms at the Port Rowan Marina *before* you arrive."
