    "description": "Death Becomes Her Funeral Limo Tour of Los Angeles is a locally operated experience in Los Angeles. A two-hour guided limo tour of Los Angeles’ most notorious true crime, scandal and paranormal sites. Sink into a custom funeral limo and glide through Hollywood, West Hollywood, and Beverly Hills while a storyteller threads together scandals, murders, overdoses, and paranormal lore. This atmospheric two-hour ride blends true crime history with noir-style narration, curated audio, and visual background materials to make each stop feel cinematic.",
