  "/destinations/united-states/wyoming/tours/winter-and-spring-wildlife-sunrise-safari-14615": {
    "description": "Winter & Spring Wildlife Sunrise Safari is a locally operated experience in Wyoming. 4 Hours · December to April Availability - Most Popular! Winter & Spring Wildlife Sunrise Safari About Winter in the Tetons is a magical time to explore and view wildlife. Animals come down from the high mountains to seek winter refuge in the valley floor giving us the perfect opportunity to photograph the wildlife living in the greater Yellowstone ecosystem.",
    "headline": "4 Hours  ·  December to April Availability - Most Popular!",
    "images": [],
    "highlights": [
      "Winter & Spring Wildlife Sunrise Safari About Winter in the Tetons is a magical time to explore and view wildlife",
      "This safari often sees elk, bison, moose, wolves, big horn sheep, mule deer, coyote, trumpeter swan, bald eagle and more",
      "The operator offers two tours this time of year, one for the early bird and the other for the night owl",
      "The guest's knowledgeable guide will take you on a tour of the wildlife hotspots, starting in the National Elk Refuge",
      "Tours depart from Jackson Hole, Wyoming"
    ]
  },
