    "meetingPoint": "Check-in is located behind 5-5088 Kuhio Hwy. Use the entrance between 'Ohanalei and HIC Surf and look for the HANALEI CHARTERS PARKING sign. Guests are greeted by a crew member, provided a dry bag for belongings, escorted to the Hanalei Rivermouth to meet the captain, and shuttled to the Adventurer vessel. Check-in begins promptly; late arrivals that miss the tour are non-refundable.",
