    "meetingPoint": "- Departure Times: 8:00 AM, 2:30 PM - Arrival Time: Please arrive 20 minutes prior to departure (by 7:40 AM, or 2:10 PM) to allow time for check-in and boarding. - Location: Kewalo Basin Harbor, Slip F28, just minutes from Waikīkī and Ala Moana. - Check-In Process: Look for the Hawaii Nautical sign outside our slip. - Parking: Paid parking is available at Kewalo Basin Harbor. We recommend arriving early to secure a spot and walk to the slip. - Boarding: Boarding closes 10 minutes before departure. Guests arriving late may not be able to join the tour."
