    "duration": "2 - 4+ Hours",
    "meetingPoint": "Please arrive early to Kewalo Basin Harbor Pier C, at least 15 min prior if getting dropped off or 30 min prior if parking. This leaves time for traffic delays, limited parking, and navigating the harbor. Our crew will meet you at the Pier C gate and board your group 5 min before departure. * Harbor address refers to the whole harbor so please type \"Hawaii Ocean Charters\" into google or apple maps for exact Pier C meeting location. * Paid Parking available ~ /hr but can be limited on very busy days [View Kewalo Harbor Parking Map (1).pdf](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0nOuSu4TjCCXjYbHR1aI)",
