    "description": "Albuquerque Rio Grande & Organic Lavender Farm E-Bike Tour is a locally operated experience in Los Ranchos De Albuquerque. 2.5 Hours · Agricultural Adventure of the Rio Grande Valley. 5 Hours Albuquerque Rio Grande & Organic Lavender Farm E-Bike Tour • Agricultural Adventure of the Rio Grande Valley the operator's E-Bike Tour begins at Los Poblanos Historic Inn & Organic Farm located at 4803 Rio Grande Blvd NW, Los Ranchos De Albuquerque, NM 87107 Experience a cycling adventure along New Mexico’s largest river, the Rio Grande. This tour begins and ends in the heart of Albuquerque.",
