    "description": "Palojoki Wilderness Snowmobile Tour (40km) is a locally operated experience in Enonteki. Guided snowmobile and sleigh experience at Hetta Huskies Homestead with options for adults and children to drive or ride. Palojoki Wilderness Cabin Snowmobile Tour Rates Person on a shared snowmobile: € 140 Person pulled behind a snowmobile in a snowmobile sleigh: € 100 Person on a solo snowmobile: € 225 Basic Info Distance: 40 km Overall Duration: c. 2 - 3 hrs Available: Throughout the winter Details This is a really fun tour to a very remote and rustic wilderness cabin that can only be accessed by skidoo or dogsled in winter or by canoe or kayak in summer. Meeting details: All adults who want to take turns driving the snowmobile must display their driving license.",
