    "description": "Kerry Way Walking Weekend is a locally operated experience in Dublin 2. Guests discover the Kerry way while staying in Glenbeigh, 3 great guided walks on the northern side of the Iveragh Peninsula. Walk Part of the Kerry way while staying in Glenbeigh Glenbeigh is a charming, traditional Irish village set on the Wild Atlantic Way and the Ring of Kerry in County Kerry, making it a perfect base for walkers on the Kerry Way. Nestled between rolling hills and the sparkling waters of Dingle Bay, the village has a warm, welcoming atmosphere with cosy pubs, cafés, and accommodation options that cater to walkers and visitors alike. The operator lists the duration as 4 days / 3 nights.",
