    "description": "Day Tour from Dublin of Wicklow, Powerscourt and Glendalough is a locally operated experience in Dublin 2. Full-day guided tour from Dublin to County Wicklow with a choice of horse riding, a guided walk, or visiting Powerscourt Gardens. Escape Dublin for a full day exploring County Wicklow, the Garden of Ireland, aboard a comfortable mini coach with a friendly local guide. The experience includes rolling hills, scenic valleys and dramatic viewpoints as you choose between a scenic horse ride, a guided mountain walk, or a stroll through Powerscourt House & Gardens. Meeting details: Meet at the Molly Malone statue on Suffolk Street, Dublin (D02 KX03) at 9:20. Other pickup locations are available for groups of 10+ upon request. Return to Dublin around 17:30.",
