    "description": "Eco Tour is a locally operated experience in Coffs Harbour. High-speed eco adventure boat ride from Coffs Harbour into the Solitary Islands Marine Park with wildlife viewing. Hold on as you speed from Coffs Harbour International Marina into the Solitary Islands Marine Park on an eco adventure boat ride. The experience includes coastal scenery and keep an eye out for wild dolphins that often surf the boat’s wake. Meeting details: Departures from Coffs Harbour International Marina; trips operate on demand and require a minimum of eight people to run.",
