    "description": "Twilight Tour is a locally operated experience in Hyden. Wave Rock Sunset Dreaming – 2 Hours · All Ages. Be mesmerised by the changing hues of Wave Rock at sunset, while overhead flocks of pink and grey galahs roost in the tree-tops as you follow the guest's local Aboriginal tour guide to Hippo's Yawn exploring the unique rock formations. A moderate climb to the top of the rock is rewarded with spectacular 360-degree view of the surrounding landscape.",
