    "description": "Kauai's Ultimate Na Pali Coast Eco Tour is a locally operated experience in Kekaha. Zodiac snorkeling adventure along the Na Pali Coast with guided snorkel stops, deli lunch, and a professional crew departing from Kekaha. Go beyond the beach on an unforgettable zodiac snorkeling journey along Kauai’s Na Pali Coast. This intimate, small-boat adventure brings you close to towering cliffs, hidden sea caves, and cascading waterfalls while expert crew share cultural stories and natural-history insights. Meeting details: Arrive by 8:30am sharp at Kikiaola/Kekaha Small Boat Harbor. Detailed meeting instructions and GPS links are provided in your confirmation email and text messages prior to the tour.",
