    "description": "Kauai’s SOUTH SIDE Zodiac Boat Snorkel Adventure is a locally operated experience in Koloa. 3 Hour Tour · Ages 5+ · 2 of the Best Remote Snorkeling Locations. Kauai's Ultimate South Shore Zodiac Boat Snorkeling Adventure Embark on a journey through Kauai's mesmerizing marine world with the operator's South Shore Zodiac Boat Snorkeling Adventure. Departing from the sunny shores of Poipu, this ocean experience promises vibrant coral reefs, captivating caves, and an incredible variety of marine life, all narrated with local knowledge from the operator's experienced captain and crew.",
