    "description": "Rescue Diver Course Day 1 is a locally operated experience in Kailua Kona. Call to book! · Become a Better Dive Buddy! 50 Duration Two day course, 7 hours each day About Rescue Diver Course Scuba divers describe the PADI Rescue Diver course as the most challenging, yet most rewarding course they’ve ever taken. Because you learn to prevent and manage problems in the water, and become more confident in the guest's skills as a diver, knowing that guests can help others if needed.",
