  "/destinations/sweden/stockholm/tours/kajakpaddling-2-timmar---eden-kajak-and-sup-540230": {
    "description": "Kajakpaddling 2 timmar - Eden Kajak & SUP is a locally operated experience in Stockholm. Rent a kayak to explore Stockholm’s beautiful waterways from Eden Kajak & SUP in downtown Stockholm. Har du någonsin velat uppleva Stockholms vackra vatten ur ett unikt perspektiv? Då är det dags att hyra kajak från LEK MER.",
    "headline": "Rent a kayak to explore Stockholm’s beautiful waterways from Eden Kajak & SUP in downtown Stockholm",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qCB6ISGFQgIinPQBwA0u"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes - Kayak - Life jacket - Paddle - Spray skirt - Tips and assistance from our knowledgeable staff",
      "Plan to bring - Weather-appropriate clothing - A change of dry clothes (expect to get wet) - Sunscreen - Water bottle - Snacks",
      "Har du någonsin velat uppleva Stockholms vackra vatten ur ett unikt perspektiv",
      "Då är det dags att hyra kajak från LEK MER",
      "Hos oss kan du hyra kajaker på alla nivåer för att utforska Stockholms innerstad på ditt eget sätt"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Please arrive 15 minutes before your session begins so you have time to get ready and can make the most of your time on the water. ## WHAT YOU SHOULD KNOW BEFORE RENTING A KAYAK Before renting a kayak from LEK MER | Kayak & SUP, there are a few important things to keep in mind. It’s important that you feel comfortable in the water and know how to swim. We also recommend wearing comfortable clothing that dries quickly if it gets wet. Don’t forget to bring sunscreen, water, and perhaps a snack if you plan to be out for an extended period. Check the wind; try to paddle so that you have the wind at your back as much as possible. Dress for the weather—remember sunscreen on sunny days and rain gear if the weather looks bad. Bring something to drink. Paddling is a sport, and it’s easy to get thirsty on the water. A water bottle filled with water is nice to have! Paddle with friends! Having a buddy on the water makes the paddling trip both more fun and safer.",
    "included": [
      "- Kayak - Life jacket - Paddle - Spray skirt - Tips and assistance from our knowledgeable staff"
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "- Dry bag - Waterproof phone case"
    ]
  },
