  "/destinations/stockholms-ln/stockholm/tours/paddling-2-timmar-vlj-kajak-eller-sup-eden-693903": {
    "description": "Paddling 2 timmar – Välj Kajak eller SUP (Eden) is a locally operated experience in Stockholm. Guests experience Stockholm from the water at Eden – 2-hour kayak or SUP rental. Paddle through the heart of Stockholm — from lush canals to iconic landmarks! Welcome to the operator's base at Eden , the perfect starting point for exploring Stockholm, the city that The Telegraph has ranked as one of the world’s absolute best for paddling.",
    "headline": "Experience Stockholm from the water at Eden – 2-hour kayak or SUP rental",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/amOv5D1HRq2a7sdA7QmZ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Vxy68iRSKKMKwjGJqJp3",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/VFbqCZWRTOQoppYGqNwx",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nxLU1APDRly4c3bZFkCw",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/JrZb0X8SziMtZxDy6ng6"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes * Kayak (single or double) or SUP board. * All safety equipment (life jacket and paddle). * A briefing on technique and tips for the best route to Pålsundet and City Hall.",
      "Plan to bring - Weather-appropriate clothing - A change of dry clothes (expect to get wet) - Sunscreen - Water bottle - Snacks",
      "Paddle through the heart of Stockholm — from lush canals to iconic landmarks",
      "From here, guests can quickly reach the city’s most photogenic and historic waterways",
      "A route full of contrasts When you start at Eden, the iconic Pålsundet is just around the corner"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Please arrive 15 minutes before your session begins so you have time to get ready and can make the most of your time on the water. ## GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU PADDLE Before you paddle from LEK MER | Kayak & SUP, there are a few important things to keep in mind. It’s important that you feel comfortable in the water and can swim. We also recommend wearing comfortable clothes that dry quickly if they get wet. Don’t forget to bring sunscreen, water, and maybe something to eat if you plan to be out for a longer period. Check the wind; try to paddle so that you have the wind at your back as much as possible. Dress for the weather—remember sunscreen on sunny days and rain gear if the weather looks bad. Bring something to drink. Paddling is a sport, and it’s easy to get thirsty on the water. A water bottle filled with water is nice to have! Paddle with friends! Having a buddy on the water makes the paddling trip both more fun and safer.",
    "included": [
      "* Kayak (single or double) or SUP board. * All safety equipment (life jacket and paddle). * A briefing on technique and tips for the best route to Pålsundet and City Hall."
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "- Dry bag - Waterproof phone case"
    ]
  },
