  "/destinations/wisconsin/middleton/tours/one-hour-rentals-609586": {
    "description": "One Hour Rentals is a locally operated experience in Middleton. Hourly paddle craft rentals on calm Lake Mendota from Marshall Boats, suitable for beginners and families. Guests discover Lake Mendota from Marshall Boats with easy hourly rentals for stand-up paddleboards, kayaks, and canoes. The protected launch location offers calm waters ideal for first-time paddlers and peaceful outings, with scenic views of shoreline nature and notable local architecture.",
    "headline": "Hourly paddle craft rentals on calm Lake Mendota from Marshall Boats, suitable for beginners and families.",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SYVzj1QSVKuoM1nwytvZ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/G3y3as4vQrqwCOYraqHn",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OKNPgDsRoSHHoMi12uti",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/VaXvl4EyRtuxvTciZXkr"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes A well-maintained boat or board. Life jackets for all ages and sizes (from newborn to adult). A variety of paddle sizes for a comfortable fit.",
      "Plan to bring Towel. Dry bag or plastic bag for your phone. Sunglasses. Sunscreen. Water and snacks.",
      "Guests discover Lake Mendota from Marshall Boats with easy hourly rentals for stand-up paddleboards, kayaks, and canoes",
      "Staff are friendly and can suggest nearby paddle destinations like Spring Harbor and Pheasant Branch for longer excursions",
      "Rentals include safety gear and paddles so guests can relax and enjoy the water at the guest's own pace"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Meet at 2101 Allen Blvd., Middleton, WI 53562 (Marshall Boats). Arrive 10–15 minutes early to check in. Please bring a photo ID; IDs are collected as collateral and returned after the rental. When you enter Marshall Park turn into the right-side parking lot. Walk the beautiful trail down to the boathouse located on the shores of Lake Mendota.",
    "included": [
      "A well-maintained boat or board. Life jackets for all ages and sizes (from newborn to adult). A variety of paddle sizes for a comfortable fit."
    ]
  },
