  "/destinations/hawaii/wailea-makena/tours/upcountry-food-cruise-439947": {
    "description": "UPCOUNTRY FOOD CRUISE is a locally operated experience in Wailea Makena. 5 Hours · BRAND NEW TOUR! This tour is the operator's first venture into a non-biking tour, and we are SUPER EXCITED to offer this unique farm to table food tour. Meet at Target in Kahului at 2PM and begin the tour with a 30 minute drive in the operator's luxury VW all electric Buzz to upcountry Kula.",
    "headline": "5 Hours  ·  BRAND NEW TOUR!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ArM6idKrTUuOp1aLSQfR",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/RJxUPy0QeGvjbLWcUjXX",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/7xFlgjuVTMSQfGFb3Dko",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/SrkCTxcdR0OiskSPutZR",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1JXTaQN9QeWCtkADUO3A",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rPFbxJ3ZSNe6WSIcxNe0",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1kODyX3URSnnNQV0MrdO",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/E1hwD7HSHWOqgwuz0qgg"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "This tour is the operator's first venture into a non-biking tour, and we are SUPER EXCITED to offer this unique farm to table food tour",
      "Meet at Target in Kahului at 2PM and begin the tour with a 30 minute drive in the operator's luxury VW all electric Buzz to upcountry Kula",
      "1st stop in Kula, Surfing Goat Dairy, where guests can get a 30 minute educational tour of the entire process, followed by a goat milking lesson",
      "Then we enjoy a mixed cheese flight with crackers, followed by their amazing truffles",
      "2nd stop, a 5 minute drive to Ocean Vodka, the true hidden gem of Maui"
    ]
  },
