  "/destinations/united-states/hawaii/wailuku/tours/2-tank-afternoon-charter-341489": {
    "description": "2 Tank Afternoon Charter is a locally operated experience in Wailuku. Sleep in, enjoy the guest's morning, then join us for two beautiful reef dives on a relaxed small-group scuba adventure. This 2-tank dive charter usually visits two sites along the Pali (the cliff area between Maalaea Harbor and Lahaina). Times Check in is at 1:00 in the afternoon and we return to the harbor between 5:00 and 6:00.",
    "headline": "Sleep in, enjoy your morning, then join us for two beautiful reef dives on a relaxed small-group scuba adventure.",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/R5uLILkCSGO1K19MB6Ew"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Tanks and weights Light Snacks Water, juice, soda",
      "Afternoon charters rock",
      "This 2-tank dive charter usually visits two sites along the Pali (the cliff area between Maalaea Harbor and Lahaina)",
      "Times Check in is at 1:00 in the afternoon and we return to the harbor between 5:00 and 6:00",
      "Light snacks, juices, sodas, and water are provided"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Please arrive at Maalaea Harbor, Slip 23 at 1:00 PM for check-in and boarding. Allow extra time for parking and harbor navigation. The boat typically returns between 5:00 PM and 6:00 PM depending on conditions and dive sites. Certified divers only. If it has been more than two years since your last dive, a refresher course, guided dive, or private guide is required before participating. **All certified divers must complete a diver medical questionnaire. Some divers may be required to obtain physician approval before diving.** Divers who require physician clearance but arrive without the necessary documentation may ride as passengers but will not be permitted to dive and will not be eligible for a refund. Rental equipment is available. Scuba package rentals (BCD, regulator, and other gear as needed) may be added during booking.",
    "included": [
      "Tanks and weights Light Snacks Water, juice, soda"
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "Scuba Gear (BCD, regulator) Nitrox Gratuities Maalaea Harbor Parking Fee"
    ]
  },
  "/destinations/united-states/hawaii/wailuku/tours/mala-pier-pali-dive-adventure-627936": {
    "description": "Mala Pier + Pali Dive Adventure is a locally operated experience in Wailuku. 6:15am · 6 Hours (approx.) · Certified Divers · Snack & Drinks included. About This Trip Mala Pier is an underwater wonderland. Originally a concrete pier, now beautifully collapsed and teeming with life, this site is home to schools of goatfish, resident turtles, white tip reef sharks, frogfish, and even the occasional spotted eagle ray.",
    "headline": "6:15am  ·  6 Hours (approx.)  ·  Certified Divers  ·  Snack & Drinks included",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/U0MGOXLXSqeb8R7VubN5"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "About This Trip Mala Pier is an underwater wonderland",
      "It’s the perfect way to wrap up the guest's morning underwater",
      "Times Check in is at 6:15 in the morning and we return to the harbor between noon and 1:00",
      "More Information This charter is for certified divers, and is also a trip that snorkelers will really enjoy",
      "Whether you're newly certified or an old pro, the operator's crew groups divers by experience level to make sure everyone has the best time possible"
    ]
  },
