    "description": "Sunset Whale Watch and 1 Tank Night Dive is a locally operated experience in Wailuku. Yes, guests can have the best of both worlds! Check in at 4:PM for the guest's sunset whale watch and follow it up with a 1 tank night dive! Times 1 Hour Before Sunset, varies seasonally About Certified divers will enjoy this trip.",
