    "description": "Carthaginian is a locally operated experience in Wailuku. Prerequisite: 25 logged dives · 6 Hours (approx.). Once a floating museum in Lahaina Harbor, the Carthaginian II now rests in about 100 feet of water just outside Lahaina—making it one of Maui’s most iconic wreck dives. This deep dive offers a dramatic descent onto a steel-hulled sailing vessel, now an artificial reef teeming with marine life.",
