      "About While the Cathedrals are the primary “notable” dives of Lana’i, there are so many lesser known sites that you don’t want to miss",
      "For instance, Menpachi offers multiple swim throughs and arches, and the Kaumalapau drift dive wows everyone above and below the surface",
      "This dive is sometimes called Barge Harbor since it’s outside the harbor on Lana’i’s western coast, nestled among stunning cliffs",
      "These dives allow more chances to spot pelagic species that cruise the nearby deep water, and of course, Lana’i always has a strong chance of dolphins"
