      "Join the Maui Pineapple Tour to experience Hawaii’s last working pineapple operation firsthand",
      "Learn about the cultivation techniques, growing cycle, and history of the famous Maui Gold Pineapple",
      "Guests can get a free pineapple to take home, pre-packaged for the airport",
      "This educational and tasty adventure is perfect for guests aged 3 and up, offering a unique glimpse into Hawaii's agricultural heritage"
