    "description": "Private Snorkel Charter is a locally operated experience in Kihei. 5 hours of 5 Star Snorkeling Enjoyment. Just want to be with the guest's family and friends and experience the comfort and privacy of the guest's own snorkeling tour? The operator's private snorkeling tour is a great way to experience all Maui Snorkeling has to offer but without the crowds.",
