    "meetingPoint": "In the morning you will want to meet up with our crew at our truck and trailer. Our boat will already be on the water with the captain doing the final checks to ensure your safety. Our crew member will be serving up Banana Bread and Coffee at the Truck and making sure everyone has signed up for their photos and waivers.",
