    "meetingPoint": "- Check-in at 10:00 a.m. at the Kihei Boat Ramp, located at 2800 S Kihei Rd, Kihei, HI 96753. Look for the “Makena Mele II,” a red-colored 40-ft raft boat. - Please note that there are multiple charter companies and similar-looking boats in the area, so make sure you come to Makena Mele II. - All guests must sign and complete the liability waiver before boarding. - Proceed to the dock and board the boat when your group is called. - The boat departs promptly at 10:30 a.m. (no exceptions), so please plan accordingly for parking and traffic delays.",
