  "/destinations/alaska/juneau/tours/mendenhall-lake-canoe-tour-116148": {
    "description": "Mendenhall Lake Canoe Tour is a locally operated experience in Juneau. A Perfect Family-Friendly Glacier Adventure in Juneau. Guests explore the Mendenhall Lake on a Canoe Adventure! The operator's professional guide leads you into exploring the serenity of the Tongass National Forest towards the Mendenhall Glacier.",
    "headline": "A Perfect Family-Friendly Glacier Adventure in Juneau",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/byqvM6r1QdyWxEnMUBSS",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1D9fF0nyQaadNFMCXiV2",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/mmRtlFYHSbqeVrAft7LS",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/VEQd51ZkS32q7O0ciXTJ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/m761BvzjTZjHoTKI1oea",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ahkhoaeuTtKSZnZ8hoGg",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/VZFXDL0SeO9rnz6xIetd"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Round-trip transportation from the cruise ship terminal Bottled water, snacks, and a hot beverage Gear/equipment: Rain jacket, rain pants",
      "Includes Xtratuf rain boots, paddling gloves, and a dry bag for personal items. Tour in English",
      "Guests explore the Mendenhall Lake on a Canoe Adventure",
      "The operator's professional guide leads you into exploring the serenity of the Tongass National Forest towards the Mendenhall Glacier",
      "One of the most accessible glaciers in North America, the Mendenhall Glacier is located just 12 miles from downtown Juneau"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Thank you for choosing Liquid Alaska Tours. We look forward to having you as our guest! ALL NORWEGIAN ENCORE GUESTS For all Norwegian Encore Guests, please meet your guide in front of your ship on the AJ dock. Your guide will be holding a blue sign that reads \"Mendenhall Glacier Ice Adventure Tour\" or \"Mendenhall Glacier Lake Canoe Tour\" depending on the tour you are participating in. NORWEGIAN BLISS MENDENHALL GLACIER ICE ADVENTURE TOUR GUESTS For Ice Adventure Tour reservations only, please meet your guide in front of your ship on the AJ dock. Your guide will be holding a blue sign that reads \"Mendenhall Glacier Ice Adventure Tour\" NORWEGIAN BLISS MENDENHALL GLACIER LAKE CANOE TOUR GUESTS For Canoe Tour Guests Only, please take AJ Dock shuttle to downtown Juneau and meet your tour guide outside of the red GoldBelt Tram building. Your guide will be standing underneath the cables holding a blue sign reading \"Liquid Alaska Tours: Mendenhall Lake Canoe Tour\". ALL OTHER CRUISE SHIP GUESTS MEETING INSTRUCTIONS Please meet your tour guide outside of the red GoldBelt Tram Tramway building. Your guide will be standing underneath the cables holding a blue sign reading \"Liquid Alaska Tours: Mendenhall Glacier Ice Adventure\". GoldBelt Tram Map Link SELF-TRANSPORT OPTION FOR GUESTS WITH VEHICLES If you would like to join us at the West Glacier Trailhead parking lot, please call us for further details. UNFORTUNATELY, WE CAN NOT COLLECT DIRECTLY FROM ANY HOTEL",
    "included": [
      "Round-trip transportation from the cruise ship terminal Bottled water, snacks, and a hot beverage Gear/equipment: Rain jacket, rain pants",
      "Xtratuf rain boots, paddling gloves, and a dry bag for personal items. Tour in English"
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "We suggest wearing comfortable, non-cotton layers If it is cooler, please bring a hat, gloves, and wear warm socks. If there is sun, please bring sunglasses."
    ]
  },
