    "description": "City Bike Tour is a locally operated experience in Amsterdam. Guests experience Amsterdam like a local on a relaxed bike ride through canals, neighborhoods, and the everyday life of the city. 5 hours, guests can explore the most beautiful and interesting areas of Amsterdam by bike. Ride along iconic canals, cross historic drawbridges, and pass landmarks such as the Anne Frank House, Rijksmuseum, and a centuries-old fort, alongside hidden streets and leafy parks.",
