    "description": "Private 4x4 Tour is a locally operated experience in Moab. A private 3-hour Hell’s Revenge 4x4 tour—just the guest's group. Drive Moab’s legendary slickrock with the guest's own guide. Private Hell’s Revenge 4x4 Tour — Just the guest's Group Experience Moab’s most iconic trail on a private, guide-led 4x4 adventure designed exclusively for the guest's group. Get behind the wheel and climb steep slickrock, cross rolling sandstone fins, and take in unforgettable red rock views on the world-famous Hell’s Revenge Trail.",
