    "description": "3 Hour Hurrah Pass Tour ✔Ride With a Guide Experience is a locally operated experience in Moab. Guided 3-hour mellow UTV tour along the Colorado River and Kane Creek showcasing wild-west scenery, petroglyphs, springs, and panoramic overlooks. This relaxed, guided 3-hour UTV tour explores Moab’s wild-west landscape along the Colorado River and historic Kane Creek. Guides provide narration on geology, local history, and ancient Fremont and Ancestral Puebloan cultures as you stop to view thousand-year-old petroglyphs and natural springs.",
