    "meetingPoint": "Your private tour includes convenient hotel pick up. Upon booking, please be sure to enter the name of your hotel and your guide will be in touch to coordinate a pick-up time. In an effort to beat crowds, we typically pick our clients up bright and early, between 5:00 and 5:45 am, depending on the hotel.",
