    "description": "2-Park Experience (Yellowstone & Grand Teton) is a locally operated experience in Wyoming. Private Experience · Groups of up to 7 Passengers. Guests experience the best of both Yellowstone and the Grand Tetons on this exclusive 2-day, 1-night private tour. The guest's adventure begins with a tailored itinerary designed to maximize the guest's experience of these iconic national parks. The operator lists the duration as Two Days, One Night.",
