    "description": "Saratoga Limousine Veterans Car Service is a locally operated experience in Wyoming. Serving the Yellowstone and Grand Teton region. The experience includes a premier transportation experience with a team of highly qualified drivers, all holding the highest United States Army security clearance. The operator's drivers are drug-tested, non-smoking, and have passed extensive FAA background checks for ramp eligibility, ensuring the guest's safety and peace of mind. The operator lists the duration as Jackson Hole to Teton Village ~ 40 Minutes * Jackson Hole Airport to Jackson ~ 20 Minutes.",
