  "/destinations/hawaii/paia/tours/maui-sunrise-volcano-bike-tour-275180": {
    "description": "Maui Sunrise Volcano Bike Tour is a locally operated experience in Paia. Pre-dawn guided tour to Haleakala summit to watch sunrise, followed by a supervised 26-mile downhill bike ride to Paia Bay with round-trip transport. The Sunrise Journey starts before dawn with transportation to Haleakala National Park, where guides share the volcano’s history, geology, and its rare plants and animals. After viewing the spectacular sunrise at the crater rim, guests can receive a comprehensive safety briefing at about 6,500 feet and embark on a 26-mile guided descent through Haleakala Ranch, upcountry Kula, Makawao, pineapple fields and ending at Paia Bay Beach Park. The operator lists the duration as Approx. 7 hours. Meeting details: Check in at 2:45 am (times vary seasonally); departure for Haleakala that pre-dawn morning. Seating is extremely limited; book early.",
    "headline": "Pre-dawn guided tour to Haleakala summit to watch sunrise, followed by a supervised 26-mile downhill bike ride to Paia Bay with round-trip transport.",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Jfspf85ZTmGjbaqQ6xc3",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/v4sCJOcDR5ekqO16I2G4",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/iSq9Z5J6QYqwpnf1TfaN",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/IOKBrjmQM6ncDxKyLrSl",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jQFH6s0CR9WOf4KFAhou",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pvPwPqM7QCq0DPKf7HSQ"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "The experience blends interpretive storytelling with an extended scenic bike ride down the slopes of the world’s largest dormant volcano"
    ],
    "duration": "Approx. 7 hours",
    "meetingPoint": "Check in at 2:45 am (times vary seasonally); departure for Haleakala that pre-dawn morning. Seating is extremely limited; book early."
  },
