  "/destinations/mexico/cabo-san-lucas/tours/mag-bay-expedition-573912": {
    "description": "Mag Bay Expedition is a locally operated experience in Cabo San Lucas. For ages 10+ · 4 nights · Explore the underwater wonders of Magdalena Bay! Scuba diving - snorkeling - hiking - ocean safari Duration 4 nights About Be one of the privileged to explore the underwater wonders of Magdalena Bay and its surrounding islands, historically known for the various shipwrecks that had happen since 300 years ago. This location is also known for its encounters with amazing sea life, such as marlins, the fastest fish on the planet, as well as Sea lions, massive schools of sardines, and many other impressive sightings.",
    "headline": "For ages 10+  ·  4 nights  ·  Explore the underwater wonders of Magdalena Bay!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/LK5opMxoTmqX1xBr1Syq",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kkAqmkoUTDqo8wFYGRnJ",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/8FfwjH2SrmMa9XOf5jgI"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Be part of a beautiful spectacle that can only be seen in Magdalena",
      "The adventure will start at the Nautilus Dive Tech facilities, where the operator will head north to the San Carlos port",
      "The operator's goal is to get to Isla Magdalena by boat and to the Glamping site, located by the shore of the island",
      "Grant that sank in early 1900, and the American submarine USS H-1 that rests in the bottom of the ocean",
      "Even sleeping under the sea of stars in the operator's Glamping zone is a truly out-of-the-ordinary experience"
    ]
  },
  "/destinations/mexico/cabo-san-lucas/tours/mobula-safari-573960": {
    "description": "Mobula Safari is a locally operated experience in Cabo San Lucas. For ages 10+! · 4 Hours safari in La Ventana! · See the Mobula Rays! Mobula Safari Duration 6 Hours About Every year, tens of thousands of mobula rays migrate to the waters of southern Baja, Mexico. These rays, also known as devil rays (Mobula Munkiana by its scientific name), are large and graceful creatures that can reach up to 3 feet in length.",
    "headline": "For ages 10+!  ·  4 Hours safari in La Ventana!  ·  See the Mobula Rays!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BidT9j4pQjezNN2RXJc0",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cdk7VOQVtFQs4hwGWwEd"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Mobula Safari Duration 6 Hours About Every year, tens of thousands of mobula rays migrate to the waters of southern Baja, Mexico",
      "These rays, also known as devil rays (Mobula Munkiana by its scientific name), are large and graceful creatures that can reach up to 3 feet in length",
      "They are attracted to the warm waters of the Sea of Cortez, where they come to breed",
      "Dare to experience spectacular views in La Ventana",
      "Located in the southern part of Isla Cerralvo; snorkel and dive in iconic sites, while being part of Baja´s natural aquarium"
    ]
  },
