    "highlights": [
      "Plan to bring Comfortable walking shoes Weather-appropriate clothing (the tour is entirely outdoors)",
      "Step into the past on this immersive, lantern-lit outdoor tour that brings Minnesota Territory to life",
      "Once a thriving town along the Minnesota River, Traverse des Sioux surged after the 1851 treaty but quickly declined",
      "Today, little remains, making this a rare chance to explore the site’s layered and often overlooked legacy"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "- Check in inside the Treaty Site History Center, 1851 Treaty Site, St. Peter, MN - Please arrive 10 minutes early; tours depart promptly",
