    "description": "'Creole & Crescent' Self-Guided Bike Tour is a locally operated experience in New Orleans. Ages 12+ · 24/7 Bike Rental Return/Storage. 'Creole & Crescent' Self-Guided Bike Tour A self-paced Self-Guided Bike Tour that is a good fit for pretty much anyone who likes new discoveries and who can ride a bike. The mellow route explores New Orleans’ historic areas, from the French Quarter to City Park and back, covering 9 miles along bike lanes and shaded streets flanked by charming neighborhoods. The operator lists the duration as 4, 8, or 24 Hour Options Available.",
