    "highlights": [
      "Includes Evergreen",
      "Includes Felicity, and Laura Plantations",
      "Guests explore one of the South's most memorable sites - Oak Alley Plantation",
      "Visitors learn about \"Life inside the \"Big House\" on an antebellum plantation for both the planter family and the enslaved",
      "This 1839 Greek Revival mansion was built with success, prestige and power in mind, therefore commanding attention"
    ],
    "duration": "5 Hours & 25 Minutes",
    "meetingPoint": "Please display your barcoded voucher as your ticket 15 minutes in advance of your tour time at our Lighthouse Ticket Office at Toulouse St. and the Mississippi River. All tours and cruises depart from here, at the Steamboat NATCHEZ dock (400 Toulouse St. New Orleans, LA 70130), directly behind the JAX Brewery. If you have any questions, please contact us by email at tours@glnosc.com or by phone at (504) 569-1401.",
