    "description": "Avalon Harbor Underwater Cleanup, California is a locally operated experience in Tempe. COME JOIN NLS AT THE AVALON HARBOR CLEANUP ON FEBRUARY 22, 2025! Every year, the Avalon Harbor in Catalina Island is open to divers for one day, and one day only. Divers from all around come to help pull debris out of the harbor that have accumulated over the year.",
