  "/destinations/minnesota/duluth/tours/the-duluth-zephyr---first-class-dome-car-602394": {
    "description": "The Duluth Zephyr - First Class Dome Car is a locally operated experience in Duluth. For All Ages! · 1 Hour & 15 Minutes · Limited Space! The Duluth Zephyr is the operator's most popular trip! Great for all ages, this train operates regularly in the summer and fall, operating a 75-minute trip (1hour, 15 minutes) through downtown, along the shoreline of Lake Superior, through the historic Congdon Neighborhood wooded area, until it reaches a side-track stopping point where the train stops briefly to turn around and return to the Depot. The operator lists the duration as 1 hour & 15 minutes.",
    "headline": "For All Ages!  ·  1 Hour & 15 Minutes  ·  Limited Space!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/mtl5hqvUS6eQ1wAfGeOA",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/IiQIylvVRiH36oyERcwN",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/W8Yt6OuUQkyWZJHVhYXF",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ufw1rrcEQP6DHBrkXG17",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4wPlXGBPRmOSlSwAuPNo"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes - **All tickets are round-trip.** - There are restrooms on the train.",
      "The Duluth Zephyr is the operator's most popular trip"
    ],
    "duration": "1 hour & 15 minutes",
    "meetingPoint": "Please be sure to arrive 20-30 minutes prior to your excursion time to pick up your tickets at the will-call desk, on the lower level (back entrance) of the Duluth Depot. It just takes a few seconds. Doors close 2 minutes prior to departure for safety checks. Any passengers who arrive after this time will not be permitted to board and will not receive a refund. Pickup your tickets at the ticket window on the day of your excursion. You will only need your last name.",
    "included": [
      "- **All tickets are round-trip.** - There are restrooms on the train."
    ]
  },
