  "/destinations/minnesota/duluth/tours/the-christmas-city-express---domecar-seats-602674": {
    "description": "The Christmas City Express - Domecar Seats is a locally operated experience in Duluth. The performance of the Christmas City Express returns this year and begins in the Lake Superior Railroad Museum, where guests can be treated to an intimate reading of the new Christmas City Express story, enjoy carolers, and a visit from a special guest! Then, climb aboard the train for a short, 30-minute ride up to Lake Superior. Onboard, enjoy a snack and holiday tunes.",
    "headline": "On Sale Now",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/iB7ARlRXuYrjj8d3YaTg",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/8OCmyFAKTVa7rS1lHS55",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1ZYJAWeTzyZ101WWjvx7",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pab39F33RcGhL1wrjAz5"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Story performance in the Lake Superior Railroad Museum, and a short train ride after. Hot cocoa and a cookie are also included with every ticket.",
      "Plan to bring Most of the event is inside, aside from boarding/beboarding and short times outside for that. Strollers are not permitted on the train.",
      "Then, climb aboard the train for a short, 30-minute ride up to Lake Superior",
      "Onboard, enjoy a snack and holiday tunes",
      "Guests can also pre-purchase the book with the guest's tickets to pick it up when you arrive"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "**All details of your excursion will be included in a confirmation email immediately after booking.** - Please arrive about 15-20 minutes prior to your performance time to pick up your tickets at the will-call desk. - There is a lobby to wait in until the show starts, but **the museum is NOT available** prior to the show (the show is in the museum). - The performance is in the museum, and the short train ride happens after activities in the museum. - Pickup your tickets at the ticket window on the day of your excursion. You will only need your last name.",
    "included": [
      "Story performance in the Lake Superior Railroad Museum, and a short train ride after. Hot cocoa and a cookie are also included with every ticket."
    ]
  },
