  "/destinations/minnesota/duluth/tours/the-northwoods-explorer--coach-seats-602685": {
    "description": "The Northwoods Explorer- Coach Seats is a locally operated experience in Duluth. For All Ages! · 2.5 Hours. A new, longer excursion during the day than the earlier Duluth Zephyr ride, this excursion brings you through downtown Duluth, a little way up the North Shore through Congdon Park, through the neighborhood of Lakeside, and then continues into the Northwoods, to Palmers Siding, about 17 miles from Duluth, between Duluth and Two Harbors. This is the location of a passing track, where the locomotive will be uncoupled and re-attached on the opposite end of the train for the return trip.",
    "headline": "For All Ages!  ·  2.5 Hours",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/0252MYiRCrXSYNoJgYAg",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pCKckotRPSq0iUNA6YOC",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/lcxuaNktTby6BrAPaKi2",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/j36PLn2dQ8msZyK0as8l"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes An unforgettable experience!",
      "This is the location of a passing track, where the locomotive will be uncoupled and re-attached on the opposite end of the train for the return trip",
      "Coach Seats: Ride in one of several historic coaches",
      "Some have open windows, some have air conditioning/heat, it is up to you",
      "All seats are general boarding, so you are free to explore the train for the perfect seat"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Please be sure to arrive 20-30 minutes prior to your excursion time to pick up your tickets at the will-call desk, on the lower level (back entrance) of the Duluth Depot. It just takes a few seconds. Doors close 2 minutes prior to departure for safety checks. Any passengers who arrive after this time will not be permitted to board and will not receive a refund. Pickup your tickets at the ticket window on the day of your excursion. You will only need your last name.",
    "included": [
      "An unforgettable experience!"
    ]
  },
