    "description": "26th Annual Chamber Music Festival Boston Chamber Music is a locally operated experience in Ogunquit. Friday June 10th · 7:30pm. Ogunquit Performing Arts presents its 26th Chamber Music Festival with a 2-concert series by Boston Chamber Music, on Friday June 3 and Friday June 10. The series will be a celebration of the music of Brahms and Dvořák, played by a piano quartet on the first evening and a string sextet on the second.",
