    "description": "27th Annual Chamber Music Festival The New Hampshire Trio is a locally operated experience in Ogunquit. Friday June 9th · 7:30pm. Ogunquit Performing Arts continues its 27th Chamber Music Festival with a performance by The New Hampshire Trio. Headed by pianist Mathilde Handelsman, the Trio was recently founded in 2021, and is the resident faculty chamber ensemble at the University of New Hampshire in Durham.",
