    "description": "Kids Dig is a locally operated experience in Belle Fourche. For the whole family ages 8 and up! · 1 Day dig & 1 day lab · Educational! If the guest's young paleontologist is looking for something that is more than just brushing sand off of plastic or planted bones, but not quite ready to join the full expedition, then the operator's new “Kids Digs” are the guest's best bet. Guests experience a one day authentic dinosaur dig to known fossil localities on private land. The operator lists the duration as 1 Day Digging • 1 Day in the Lab. Meeting details: Best to arrive at the Dinosaur of the Hell Creek Museum by about 7:50 am. Lecture and museum tour will begin at 8:00 sharp.",
