    "description": "Canoe Safari is a locally operated experience in Ambergate. Grade 1-2 Rapids · Splashy · Beginner Suitable. A fun-packed 5km river journey that dives straight into action, starting with splashy Grade 1–2 rapids before easing into a relaxed, scenic paddle downstream. Guests can hit the exciting white water early on, giving you an instant taste of river adventure, then settle into a sociable paddle through Matlock Bath, with time to enjoy the surroundings, chat, and build confidence as the river mellows. The operator lists the duration as Approx 2.5hrs.",
