    "description": "Sunset Zip Line Tour is a locally operated experience in Moab. A sunset adventure combining six zip lines, a 100-foot suspension bridge, 4x4 off-roading and sunset views. This adventure tour includes a 4x4 off-road ascent, six zip lines—the longest land-to-land course in the United States—and a walk across a 100-foot suspension bridge amid Moab’s red rock fins. Guests ride UTVs to Raven's Rim for exclusive sunset vistas of the La Sal Mountains and surrounding desert, enjoy a complimentary beverage to toast the view, and return downhill as evening falls. Meeting details: Arrive for check-in 20 minutes prior to the scheduled tour time at the main street office (tour begins there).",
