      "5-hour boat tour by motor up Jamaica’s largest navigable river and through what is Jamaica’s largest wetland area",
      "Over 100 species of birds have been recorded in the Black River morass and many are seen during the guest's trip",
      "The highlight of the Black River is the thrill of sighting a crocodile and watching them being fed from the guest's boat",
      "The operator's adventure continues as we journey to one of Jamaica’s most beautiful and spectacular waterfalls, ”The YS Falls\""
