    "description": "Wagon Master's Breakfast Ride is a locally operated experience in Hill City. A unique western style breakfast experience. About Wagon Master’s Breakfast Ride Join us for a one of kind early morning breakfast cookout. Participants will load up on an authentic HORSE drawn COVERED wagons for an enjoyable 30 min ride into the beautiful Black Hills National Forest; arriving at the operator's Chuck Wagon camp in time to watch Dutch oven cooks prepare a memorable and hearty breakfast over a wood fire.",
