    "meetingPoint": "Check-in is 1 hour prior to your trip time. This allows us time to confirm waivers, check-in your group, give you your safety briefing, and be on the way to start your activity by the time you booked for. ___ - We require every guest to have a waiver with their legal first name, last, and date of birth. The link to the waiver will be sent in a separate email from Wherewolf. We recommend the waivers are filled out prior to arriving for check-in. ____ - We confirm identity at check-in. Please bring a valid photo ID and/or the card used to make payment. Both items should match the name on the reservation."
