    "description": "Northfork Whitewater Adventure is a locally operated experience in Cody. Ages 12+ · 4-4.5hr total · An absolutely unforgettable experience on the Northfork of the Shoshone! Spend a half-day enjoying the thrill of whitewater and the breathtaking scenic beauty of the Northfork Shoshone River. It’s not uncommon to see wildlife on this trip, creating an unforgettable experience for everyone. The operator lists the duration as 4.5 Hours total.",
