    "description": "Sunset Cruise on Yacht Manhattan is a locally operated experience in New York. Guests experience a beautiful New York City sunset and the illuminated cityscape during a comfortable and unique NYC Harbor sunset cruise through the Hudson and East Rivers. Sit back and enjoy the gorgeous 360-degree view of the island from the open decks or the glassed-in back-deck observatory of these Gatsby-esque 1920s style yachts. Join us aboard one of the operator's classic Manhattan yachts and witness the city's beauty and elegance under the setting sun!",
