  "/destinations/wales/llangollen/tours/open-canoe-aqueduct-tour-160745": {
    "description": "Open Canoe Aqueduct Tour is a locally operated experience in Llangollen. A 2.5-hour guided canoe tour along the Llangollen Canal with a calm crossing of the world’s highest aqueduct and immersive landscape interpretation. There’s a reason this is called the Aqueduct Canoe Tour: it’s a slow, unhurried journey along the Llangollen Canal that unfolds the landscape and history around the famous aqueduct. 5 hours you paddle through quiet canal stretches, learn how the waterway works, and build a steady rhythm before the highlight — gliding across the highest aqueduct in the world.",
    "headline": "A 2.5-hour guided canoe tour along the Llangollen Canal with a calm crossing of the world’s highest aqueduct and immersive landscape interpretation.",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OSkO1BvQjKECKtrcLHxA",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/iRRZOQ4JSv2afwp5JCv5",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/GJOEoVNxTaqyP1XZcx1r",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/gZshUKF5SKeqy7P0BjT6",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/R3gtc94T1GdIXchPwFlb",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3CXAcaD7RHGWpoWsPI45",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cAdUNVAARzaKbFULC4xi",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/d2zU833BQDCmyvfzDgC5"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Toilets and showers Free wifi Award-winning cafe Dog-friendly cafe On-site hotel",
      "Plan to bring Weather appropriate clothing Camera",
      "Led by experienced guides, the tour is immersive and quietly memorable, offering context as well as the crossing itself"
    ],
    "included": [
      "Toilets and showers Free wifi Award-winning cafe Dog-friendly cafe On-site hotel"
    ]
  },
