  "/destinations/minnesota/independence/tours/public-sauna-cold-plunge-session-679451": {
    "description": "Public Sauna / Cold Plunge Session is a locally operated experience in Independence. Ages 7+ · 2 Hour Passes · Thursday - Sunday. An outdoor sauna village operating 4 days per week on the lakefront of a beautiful 175+ acre wilderness camp just outside Minneapolis. 7+ wood-fired saunas of all shapes & sizes, multiple natural ice plunges cut into the frozen lake, community warming huts and clubhouse & group campfires.",
    "headline": "Ages 7+  ·  2 Hour Passes  ·  Thursday - Sunday",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/DKWcb3qrSOf8KZTaP79B",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kGIEqBTu2uKD0Pdb9znw",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Wra1bYYHQSqTSC5IjbT1",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cApssRFDSzKh4jeXd2Ly"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "An outdoor sauna village operating 4 days per week on the lakefront of a beautiful 175+ acre wilderness camp just outside Minneapolis",
      "We are home to the largest mobile barrel sauna in the U",
      "That holds up to 20 people at a time and features two wood-burning stoves",
      "We also have saunas as well that all range in temperatures to allow you to pick a sauna that best suits you or try them all out"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "- Sign your digital waivers before arriving to Camp. These are mandatory before entry and can be found in your confirmation email. You can also find your QR code for checkin and map of camp there. - Arrival: From the parking lot of Camp Ihduhapi (our host location), look for the path indicated with lights and a sign that says “Sauna Camp This Way”. Keep following the increasing “temperature signs” to be directed toward the lake where you'll be greeted by our staff members! - Bathrooms: There are bathrooms adjacent to each of the parking lots. Note: there are only showers in the bath house next to the overflow parking lot further down the path. Please see the map on our website if you have more questions. - Changing Area: Bins are available to store your clothes, and changing areas are provided for changing if needed at the lake, but you can also use the bathhouses before/after too."
  },
