    "description": "Private Sauna / Cold Plunge Session is a locally operated experience in Independence. Ages 7+ · 2 Hour Passes · Thursday - Sunday. This experience features the operator's signature private sauna experience where guests can enjoy any size private barrel sauna with a beautiful Iki stove and clear western red cedar and full viewing glass. Select quantity 1 unless the guest's group needs multiple saunas, as the price reflects the entire sauna rental not per person.",
