    "meetingPoint": "Check-in time varies by season — as early as 5:00 PM in winter, as late as 7:00 PM in summer. Time is confirmed when you book. Scuba-Fun Dive Center, 99222 Overseas Highway, Key Largo. Free parking on-site."
