    "description": "American Canoe Association Level 2: Essentials of Kayak Touring is a locally operated experience in Xbia. Call to Book · From €200 · Paddle with Excellence. Level 2 Coastal Kayaking Course by Siesta Advisor: A Journey to Mastery with ACA Standards Rates Level 2 Coastal Kayaking Certification (€200) Level 3 Coastal Kayaking Certification (€250) Introduction to the American Canoe Association (ACA) and the operator's Instructors Embark on an enriching kayaking journey with Siesta Advisor, guided by the prestigious standards of the American Canoe Association (ACA) - the world's leading authority in paddle sports. The ACA's commitment to safety, education, and environmental stewardship is at the heart of the operator's Level 2 Coastal Kayaking Course.",
