      "It's an entry-level course to coastal kayaking where guests can hone the guest's skills and prepare for more adventurous explorations",
      "- Edging and Bracing: Develop skills in low brace recovery and turns, and understand edge control to enhance turning efficiency and kayak stability",
      "- Rescue Skills: Gain proficiency in essential self-rescue techniques and assisted rescues, ensuring safety and preparedness in open waters"
