    "description": "Private Secret Local Sandbars Escape is a locally operated experience in Stock Island. The quiet sandbars locals run to — not the Boca Grande boat-party crowd. A four-hour private sandbar charter to whichever of the Lower Keys’ hidden shallows is firing that day — Snipes Keys, Jewfish Basin, Mud Keys, Sand Key, or one of the unnamed flats only seasoned local captains know. We anchor in waist-deep crystal water, deploy floats and a Lily Pad, and you get a Key West sandbar afternoon without the crowd. Meeting details: Parking and Location: Free parking is available adjacent to the Hotel and Marina. The boat is located on Dock A, Slip #32. Arrive 15 minutes before departure.",
