    "description": "Private Dolphin Playground Safari is a locally operated experience in Stock Island. Wild Atlantic dolphins on their own time. A three-hour private charter to the shallow backcountry channels where Atlantic bottlenose dolphins live and play year-round. The guest's USCG-licensed captain knows the local pods by behavior pattern, cuts the engines in the right spots, and you drift in quiet water — often within a few yards of the boat. Meeting details: Parking and Location: Free parking is available adjacent to the Hotel and Marina. The boat is located on Dock A, Slip #32. Arrive 15 minutes before departure.",
