    "description": "2024 Night Photoshoot - Vintage Glow: Night Shoot with LA's Yellow Cars is a locally operated experience in Perris. August 17th · 8pm to 11pm · All ages welcome. Whether you are a rail fan, photographer, or just love Southern California Railway Museum, this is something you won’t want to miss! Important Info - Duration: 8pm to 11pm - All ages welcome About SCRM is opening its doors after-hours for a unique Night Photoshoot experience.",
