    "description": "Antique Truck Show is a locally operated experience in Perris. The past roars to life at the Antique Truck Show at the Southern California Railway Museum in Perris. Presented with the American Truck Historical Society Southern California Chapter, this one-day event showcases hundreds of restored vintage trucks — from semis and pickups to delivery, farm, and fire equipment — alongside rolling locomotives and streetcars. Guests can enjoy extensive photo opportunities as trucks and trains pose together, plus museum exhibits and multiple rides throughout the day.",
