    "description": "Train and Trolley Rides is a locally operated experience in Perris. All Day Rides · All Ages Welcome. About Visit the Southern California Railway Museum in Perris, CA to explore the West’s largest collection of railway locomotives, passenger and freight cars, streetcars, interurban electric cars, buildings and other artifacts dating from the 1870’s. Ride streetcars, interurban electric cars, and trains on the Museum railway on our 100 acre campus. The operator lists the duration as All Day Rides. Meeting details: - Please bring a digital or print copy of your tickets in your confirmation email - Use your digital or print copy to check in at the Museum Store, Pinacate Station, and receive your all-day ride ticket.",
