    "meetingPoint": "Your tour guides will meet you in the parking lot next to a blue kayak trailer. Once you locate your guides, they’ll get you checked in and ready for your adventure! **Important**: This is a natural launch location and does not have public restrooms. Please use the restroom before arriving for your tour.",
