    "description": "Highlights Tour is a locally operated experience in Spring Green. The operator's most popular guided tour! The Highlights Tour is the operator's most popular tour! This experience is led by a knowledgeable tour guide and showcases the property’s most notable highlights: Taliesin and Hillside Drafting Studio and Theater. The operator lists the duration as Approximately 2.5 Hours.",
