    "description": "Estate Tour is a locally operated experience in Spring Green. The operator's most in-depth guided tour! The Estate Tour offers an unforgettable 4-hour guided experience of Taliesin, Frank Lloyd Wright’s 800-acre home and estate. Led by a knowledgeable and engaging guide, this tour invites you to immerse yourself in Wright’s world as you explore Hillside Drafting Studio, Hillside Theater, Taliesin, and more! The operator lists the duration as Approximately 4 Hours.",
