  "/destinations/minnesota/roseville/tours/cat-lounge-reservations---rv-434649": {
    "description": "Cat Lounge Reservations - RV is a locally operated experience in Roseville. 1 Hour · Ages 7+ · Make a New Furry Friend! Visit with up to 30 rescue cats, all available for adoption in a lounge-like atmosphere built for cat and human interaction at The Cafe Meow Roseville!! If you are looking to relax, adopt, or meet a friend, do it in the company of cats.",
    "headline": "1 Hour  ·  Ages 7+  ·  Make a New Furry Friend!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/wnZPU8j6RdmK06VG8Vz6",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/bzevK10ZQcCkDgKFNCiD",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/HsNOWHrVRfGL2qgu9JdG"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Visit with up to 30 rescue cats, all available for adoption in a lounge-like atmosphere built for cat and human interaction at The Cafe Meow Roseville",
      "If you are looking to relax, adopt, or meet a friend, do it in the company of cats"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Check-in with the cashier located in the cafe at arrival. Arrive 15 minutes early to make sure you get into the lounge on time. (Except for the first hour of the day.) - Upon entry, and leaving, make sure the first door is completely closed before opening the second so cats do not escape. - Use hand sanitizer before and after petting the cats. - Cat lounge time always starts and ends on the hour. If you arrive late that is okay but your hour will end at the end of the scheduled booking. - Do not wake a sleeping cat. (Soft pets and photos, no flash, are fine) - Do not pick up cats. (Unless they sneak into the double doorway, please help them safely back into the cat lounge.) - Do not use your fingers or toes to play with cats, pull on, push, or chase a cat. - No outside food or treats are allowed, for human or cat consumption. - Do not feed cats any human food or drinks. Make sure to watch any food/beverage you bring into the room and take it out with you as well. (We sell a certain amount of cat treats for purchase each day, ask if there are some available when you check in.) **Extra Reminders For Kids:** - Do not touch the cat food or water! - Do not climb on the furniture. - Use inside voices. - No running please. Thank you for helping us keep a safe and enjoyable environment for both guests and cats."
  },
