  "/destinations/alaska/fairbanks/tours/1-hour-private-day-mush-65869": {
    "description": "1-Hour Private Day Mush is a locally operated experience in Fairbanks. December 1st - March 31st. Mush Into a Winter Wonderland—Experience one of the longest mushing trails in Fairbanks! Glide down the operator's pristine winter trails on the operator's scenic dog sledding tour!",
    "headline": "December 1st - March 31st",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/FRrYBgXYRUSVe6NiCXIz",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nCVK8SYiRW8zg3lUAf87",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/X3389tAITySG4Yg5MYM5",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/LvyNWL8rRSKG3Cer45uA",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/baxARlM4SXCUlW8u8cmC",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/oZZp4n7uS3SLl1PsEZK2",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/200VXkT9GSiHNxZdPX2w",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/VRevlrXjRPK9mZob8TdI"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Plan to bring Camera Water Sunny Days: Sun Glasses Hand Warmers: Great for keeping your phones warm and preventing them from dying from the cold.",
      "Mush Into a Winter Wonderland—Experience one of the longest mushing trails in Fairbanks",
      "Glide down the operator's pristine winter trails on the operator's scenic dog sledding tour",
      "More than a tour—We guarantee an artisanal Alaskan adventure to last a lifetime"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Arrival Time: 5-10 minutes prior to start time #How to Dress:# Dress in layers. **Tight is COLD, dress in loose fitted clothing.** - Base Layer: Wear synthetic thermals that are tight fitting for your top and bottom pieces. Tuck your top layer into your bottom layer to ensure your midsection stays warm and your shirt does not ride up. - Mid Layer: Fleece is a comfortable and affordable midlayer to wear. We recommend fleece pajama bottoms paired with a hoodie. This can be loose fitting. - Outer Layer: Snow pants and a PUFF jacket (down or synthetic) are the warmest. - Feet: Tight boots mean COLD FEET! We will provide arctic rated boots that will allow your toes wiggle room to stay warm. ##Weather & Temperature - The weather in the interior in typically cold & clear. Temperatures on these days average negative 10-20F (below zero). - On snowy days, it's warm & cloudy. Temperatures average 10-20F (above zero).",
    "notIncluded": [
      "- Transportation is NOT included - Face protection: Neck Gaiter (**essential**) - Children's Cold Weather Gear: **Limited**"
    ]
  },
