    "description": "Sunday Salon Lecture: \"Thomas Cole and Connecticut: A Closer Look\" with Erin Monroe, Curator is a locally operated experience in Catskill. All ages · Sun, Dec 6 · Free with admission. Join Erin Monroe, Krieble Curator of American Paintings and Sculpture Wadsworth Atheneum Museum of Art, for a lecture on the landscape painting tradition, Thomas Cole, and the Hudson River School of Art. Guests discover how time spent in Connecticut profoundly shaped the early works of Thomas Cole and his Connecticut-born protégé, Frederic Church.",
