    "description": "Snowdrift Sprint (Approx. 2 Hours) is a locally operated experience in Danbury. Venture into a snow-covered winter wonderland on the Frosted Pine Loop, the operator's signature 2-hour self-guided snowmobile route through the heart of the Northwoods. Ride at the guest's own pace along groomed, clearly marked forest trails surrounded by towering pines, sparkling frost, and quiet winter scenery. After a brief orientation on operation and safety, guests can set off on the guest's own sled with a GPS map and easy-to-follow trail markers. The operator lists the duration as Approx. 2 hrs. Meeting details: Please arrive 30 minutes prior to your reservation start time. Your adventure begins at the start time of your reservation, so arrive on time!.",
