  "/destinations/alberta/calgary/tours/calgary-city-bike-tour-529962": {
    "description": "Calgary City Bike Tour is a locally operated experience in Calgary. Ages 12+ · 3 Hours · 18km/11miles · Summer · Difficulty Level: Moderate. Calgary City Bike Tour - Overview Embark on an unforgettable 3-hour Bike Tour of Calgary and experience the city like a local, guided by the stories and insights of the operator's enthusiastic guides. --- Picture this: we'll weave through the bike-friendly streets , venture into scenic trails, and pedal beside the breathtaking Bow River , Calgary's crown jewel.",
    "headline": "Ages 12+  ·  3 Hours  ·  18km/11miles  ·  Summer  ·  Difficulty Level: Moderate",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/piNM3z6VQOWfn5l8t2mf",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/EC1oWPVdSnSMXJrp3OXu",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/aL0CLjEBSH2NLRm5iKSk",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/QhZMpAjIR1ayNyfwlz0U",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WTpc7i6HQLK6ARTNdIcD",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rFanhK6NQr6eEwLDYwjZ"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Bike rental & helmet (e-bike if selected) English-speaking tour guide Bike light (when needed)",
      "' --- Great Tour Guarantee Ensuring the guest's satisfaction is the operator's paramount mission",
      "If, by any chance, the guest's experience leaves you less than completely satisfied, please do not hesitate to inform us",
      "We are committed to addressing any concerns promptly and thoroughly, leaving no room for uncertainty",
      "The guest's time is highly valued, and we sincerely appreciate the guest's choice to spend it with the operator"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "* Previous cycling experience is required. For your safety and the safety of our group, the tour guide will assess your ability to ride a bike. If your skills are insufficient for what’s required, you may be unable to join the tour and will be refunded. * Please arrive at the bike shop **15-20 minutes prior** to your tour. The tour departs promptly at the scheduled time. Before departing the bike shop, we will adjust a bicycle for you, suit you up with a helmet, and confirm you have completed a waiver. * Parking must be obtained for at least **3.5 hours**. We recommend taking public transit or walking to meet us at **Toonie Tours Calgary HQ**. Late comers risk the tour leaving without them. * There is a **washroom break** roughly **1.5 hours** into the tour.",
    "included": [
      "Bike rental & helmet (e-bike if selected) English-speaking tour guide Bike light (when needed)"
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "Gratuities for your guide Food & beverages"
    ]
  },
