  "/destinations/british-columbia/vancouver/tours/the-stanley-park-bike-tour-of-vancouver-530042": {
    "description": "The Stanley Park Bike Tour of Vancouver is a locally operated experience in Vancouver. Ages 12+ · 3 Hours · 18km/11miles · Difficulty Level: Moderate. Vancouver City Bike Tour - Overview Discover Stanley Park with a local and unlock the true essence of the city's gem. This bike tour is that nostalgic, childhood ride through the wilderness, where each pedal stroke is a beat of serenity and rejuvenation.",
    "headline": "Ages 12+  ·  3 Hours  ·  18km/11miles  ·  Difficulty Level: Moderate",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1nkfDXkRSNO7RSvtBvde",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rg6Z3VcDR0a9zRajT1fe",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WZRtbh1OQs2XjIHbi95o",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/nFo2DTnSb6DLyJJMvM9D",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/hYWoBCimSieaf3lFFlts",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OWNS0QWaQi2ElfZyTvqs"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Bike rental & helmet (e-bike if selected) English-speaking tour guide Rain poncho (when needed)",
      "Vancouver City Bike Tour - Overview Discover Stanley Park with a local and unlock the true essence of the city's gem",
      "This bike tour is that nostalgic, childhood ride through the wilderness, where each pedal stroke is a beat of serenity and rejuvenation",
      "Feel the rhythm of the guest's heartbeat synchronise with the rustling leaves of ancient cedars",
      "Marvel at the park's iconic totems, each a living testament to indigenous heritage and timeless traditions"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "- Previous cycling experience is required. For your safety and the safety of our group, the tour guide will assess your ability to ride a bike. If your skills are insufficient for what’s required, you may be unable to join the tour and will be refunded. - Please arrive at the bike shop **15–20 minutes prior** to your tour. The tour departs promptly at the scheduled time. Before departing, we will adjust a bicycle for you, suit you up with a helmet, and confirm you have completed a waiver. - Parking must be obtained for at least **3.5 hours**. We recommend taking public transit or walking to meet us at Freedom Bikes. As we respect the time of all guests, latecomers risk the tour leaving without them. - There is **no washroom** available at Freedom Bikes — please use one before you arrive. There is a washroom break roughly **1.5 hours** into the tour.",
    "included": [
      "Bike rental & helmet (e-bike if selected) English-speaking tour guide Rain poncho (when needed)"
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "Gratuities for your guide Food & beverages"
    ]
  },
