  "/destinations/spain/bilbo/tours/highlights-e-bike-tour-159053": {
    "description": "Highlights E-bike Tour is a locally operated experience in Bilbo. The best way to discover Bilbao! The city of Bilbao has changed radically in the last 20 years, from being a merely industrial city to becoming an avant-garde city that elegantly combines tradition and modernity. In this e-bike tour, we want you to discover and enjoy both the antique Bilbao and that new modern Bilbao.",
    "headline": "The best way to discover Bilbao!",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/7OVbYYbRCmlrRIxRiHUj",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/81H34KvGRW64zIgx0vlj",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/25vy1MJaRfCvHh4G3MoX",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1xP6xcmLSX6TWKvb7Nv8",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/YtmRmvkYTmaUPcf9Lcb8",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Fa2E5l5sQHChfdlypNjc",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/VkfR4vQXKnFqxLF0tvJQ"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes - Comfortabele E-bike - A complete overview of Bilbao in 3-hours + tips for after the tour - Unique tour experience with a local guide",
      "In this e-bike tour, we want you to discover and enjoy both the antique Bilbao and that new modern Bilbao",
      "The operator's local guides will tell you all about the operator's culture from, the operator's traditions and the operator's customs",
      "Pass by reference buildings such as the Guggenheim Museum and the Euskalduna Palace, but also those places that you would not discover by yourself",
      "The entire route runs through bike lanes and enabled areas away from busy traffic lanes, guaranteeing safety throughout the entire route"
    ],
    "included": [
      "- Comfortabele E-bike - A complete overview of Bilbao in 3-hours + tips for after the tour - Unique tour experience with a local guide"
    ]
  },
