    "description": "Barcelona: Christmas Lights and Markets Bike Tour is a locally operated experience in Barcelona. All ages · 3 Hours · Experience the magic of Barcelona at Christmas! Guests experience the magic of Barcelona at Christmas on the operator's exclusive 3-hour bike tour, specially designed to immerse you in the festive atmosphere of Catalonia. Guided by a local expert, this tour combines the city's rich history, culture, and unique Christmas traditions with incredible decorations, light shows, and seasonal cheer.",
