    "description": "Port Douglas Mossman Gorge Tour is a locally operated experience in Port Douglas. Leaving behind the buzz of Port Douglas, the open-air trike offers a unique perspective on the region's stunning beauty. With 360-degree views, enjoy the warm air rich with the scent of eucalyptus and the sound of distant birdcalls. Nestled in the southern part of the Daintree Rainforest, the gorge is a sacred place for the Kuku Yalanji people and a natural treasure trove of crystal-clear streams, granite boulders, and emerald-green forest.",
