    "description": "Sail and Cycle Tour is a locally operated experience in Callander. For ages 14+ · 3-4 Hours · The relaxed option! · From £150 per person. The experience includes a relaxing cruise on the historic steamship SS Sir Walter Scott to Stronachlacher at the head of stunning Loch Katrine ( occasionally other vessels provide the service). There's an option to pop into the Pier Cafe for a bite to eat from their quality menu ( not included), before we take the operator's time to cycle back along the lochside private road to Trossachs Pier. Meeting details: Arrive promptly at 10am for 10.30am sailing.",
