    "description": "Haleakala & Iao Valley is a locally operated experience in Kihei. Guests explore Haleakalā’s summit and lush ʻĪao Valley on a private Maui tour combining volcanic landscapes, culture, nature & views. Guests experience two of Maui’s most dramatic landscapes in one private day: the 10,023-foot summit of Haleakalā and the lush, stream-carved beauty of ʻĪao Valley. Guests explore Haleakalā’s volcanic landscape, sweeping viewpoints, native ecology, and extraordinary geology before descending into Central Maui.",
