    "description": "DC Private Cart Tour is a locally operated experience in Washington. Private DC experience! On the operator's all-electric vehicles each accommodating up to six passengers, guests can be whisked away along the National Mall, where all of DC’s most beautiful and noteworthy monuments. Sit back and relax as we take a leisurely drive past The White House and US Capitol, as well as other renowned monuments along the Mall, like the Lincoln Memorial, with the scenic Potomac River flowing behind.",
