    "description": "Key West Tour with Dolphin Spotting Boat from Miami is a locally operated experience in Miami Beach. Full-day coach trip from Miami to Key West with a dolphin-spotting boat tour and free time to explore the island. Travel from Miami to Key West on a scenic, full-day excursion that blends urban highlights with coastal beauty. The experience includes a comfortable coach journey along the Overseas Highway, watch for dolphins on a guided boat tour, and spend leisurely free time wandering Key West’s colorful streets, sampling seafood, and soaking up the island atmosphere. Meeting details: Meet at 700 Collins Avenue, Miami Beach, FL 33139. Pick up is provided from any Miami Beach hotel along 7500 to 600 Collins Avenue or at 340 Biscayne Boulevard in Downtown Miami.",
    "headline": "Full-day coach trip from Miami to Key West with a dolphin-spotting boat tour and free time to explore the island.",
