    "description": "Pedal to Wine (E-Bikes) is a locally operated experience in Cottonwood. Guided e-bike vineyard tour. About This epic, guided e-bike tour starts at the beautiful Alcantara Vineyard & winds down to the Verde River, then looping back to the winery where the guest's credit awaits. Expect to be wowed by the wildlife, beautiful vineyard setting, and the Scenic Verde River.",
