    "description": "Children's Snowmobile Tour is a locally operated experience in Manchester. 25 Minutes · Ages 7+ · The coolest thing the guest's kid can drive during the guest's visit to Southern Vermont. It seems like the kids are always sitting passenger, why not let them drive? Duration 25 Minutes How it works: These children's snowmobile tours last 25 minutes and come with a tour guide to teach the guest's little one how to safely drive and maneuver a miniature snowmobile!",
