    "description": "Self Guided Paddling Tour (Intermediate) is a locally operated experience in International Falls. All day · 1 or 2 people · 1 Canoe or 1 Kayak. Do you want to spend a day canoeing or kayaking but don’t know where to go? 5 hours (9am - 6:30pm) About Explore Voyageurs National Park with one of the operator's self guided tours.",
