  "/destinations/united-states/minnesota/international-falls/tours/kettle-falls-all-day-fishing-tour-644285": {
    "description": "Kettle Falls All Day Fishing Tour is a locally operated experience in International Falls. 8 Hours · All-Inclusive · Departs from Thunderbird Lodge. Spend the day on world-famous Rainy Lake with an experienced local guide and discover why Voyageurs National Park is a notable destination for anglers and adventurers alike. Whether you’re a seasoned pro or casting a line for the first time, this all-day guided fishing tour is tailored to the guest's skill level and interests.",
    "headline": "8 Hours  ·  All-Inclusive  ·  Departs from Thunderbird Lodge",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/xhsQMWpeTKG3mvmMK6V2"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Guests can fish from a fully equipped Lund Tyee—a comfortable, high-performance fishing boat—using top-quality gear and tackle provided by us",
      "We'll chase Rainy Lake’s legendary species, including walleye, northern pike, smallmouth bass, and crappie",
      "The guest's guide will customize the day based on seasonal activity and the guest's preferences",
      "We launch at 9:00 AM from Thunderbird Lodge and return by 5:00 PM",
      "Every trip is a blend of fishing action, wild beauty, and stories from the lake that you won’t forget"
    ]
  },
