    "highlights": [
      "Includes Four-hour e-bike rental Helmet Bike bag for layers or snacks Route map on your smartphone Mid-ride support 10% off purchases at Sugarbush Farm Vermont Bike & Brew souvenir glass",
      "Choose an 11-mile or 20-mile route and climb the hills with ease, thanks to the powerful pedal-assist Bosch motors",
      "The ride includes a stop at a fourth-generation maple farm and sugar shack for treats and a local taste of Vermont",
      "The Tour includes the guest's bike rental, helmet, bike bag, route map on the guest's smartphone, a discount at the maple farm, and mid-ride support",
      "Heads Up: Quechee is in a hilly area, that's why it's so beautiful"
    ],
    "meetingPoint": "Meet us in the main parking lot at the Balloon Festival. E-bike delivery and pickup are included as part of the tour. Look for the green Vermont Bike & Brew tent near the entrance to the parking lot.",
