    "description": "Traveller with Little Time is a locally operated experience in Pipiriki. Ages 7+! · 5 hours · Great for couples and families! · Exploring the native scenery! The guest's driver/guide will jet boat you upriver for 13 kms stopping along the way sharing with you the operator's local history and stories of the river and will give you instructions and a demonstration on how to operate the guest's canoe before you paddle yourself/s back to Pipiriki, exploring and enjoying the native scenery, deep river gorges and some of the more exciting rapids along the way. Meeting details: Please arrive 15mins prior to departure.",
