    "description": "The Overnighter Tour is a locally operated experience in Pipiriki. Combined one-day guided jetboat and two-day canoe or kayak trip on the Whanganui River with an overnight at Tieke Kāinga. This guided Whanganui River adventure begins with a scenic jetboat transfer and a guided walk to the Bridge to Nowhere before you paddle into the heart of the river. Spend the night at Tieke Kāinga in a hut for an authentic riverside stay, then on day two paddle approximately 20 km back to Pipiriki through a mix of long flat stretches and refreshing rapids. Meeting details: Meet at 2522 Pipiriki Raetihi Road, Pipiriki 4576. Check in 9.15 - 9.30am. Depart at 10am.",
