  "/destinations/italy/albese-con-cassano/tours/lake-como-hiking-tour---one-night-camp-652282": {
    "description": "Lake Como Hiking Tour - One Night Camp is a locally operated experience in Albese Con Cassano. For all ages! · One night · Experience a challenging yet rewarding journey. Guests experience a challenging yet rewarding journey with our 24-hour endurance training event in the scenic region of Albese con Cassano. Embark on a theoretical and practical training that stretches from the beautiful paths of San Primo to the panoramic views of Sormano, then traverses the majestic peaks of Corni di Canzo and Cornizzolo, before winding down to the serene landscapes of Valmadrera, Alserio, and back to Albese con Cassano.",
    "headline": "For all ages!  ·  One night  ·  Experience a challenging yet rewarding journey",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/jPslCjKZR2SkCZrerSzY"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Guests experience a challenging yet rewarding journey with our 24-hour endurance training event in the scenic region of Albese con Cassano",
      "This is more than just a training session; it's an opportunity to delve deep within yourself while enjoying the camaraderie of a group",
      "Embrace this adventure, where every step is a stride towards self-discovery",
      "The guest's guide is a professional coach and trainer who uses sports and outdoor adventures to help people grow stronger in body and mind",
      "He organizes group classes and personal training sessions, leading slow trail runs, ultra trail runs, and trekking outings in the local territory"
    ],
    "notIncluded": [
      "Bring your own food and water - there won't be a proper lunch break but several stops to re-energize."
    ]
  },
