    "description": "Wilderness First Aid & Avalanche Rescue Skills is a locally operated experience in Kalispell. 3 day course · Learn winter first aid & rescue skills. This three day combined Wilderness First Aid and Avalanche Rescue course is a unique offering for those wishing to learn or refresh their skills for unburying a victim caught in an avalanche and providing first aid to a patient in a winter backcountry setting. Winter emergency scenarios, especially avalanche burials, are often complex.",
