    "description": "Round Trip North Shore Haleiwa Shuttle is a locally operated experience in Honolulu. All Ages · Departs Waikiki for Haleiwa at 8:00 AM · Returns to Waikiki at 3:30 PM · Up to 9 Pass. Guests experience the Best of Oahu's North Shore with the operator's Convenient Haleiwa Shuttle! Escape the hustle and bustle of Waikiki and discover the laid-back charm of Haleiwa and the iconic North Shore with Wildlife Hawaii's round-trip shuttle service.",
