    "description": "Wildlife Tour in Yellowstone is a locally operated experience in Gardiner. All Ages · Half Day and Full Day available · Search for Bears, Wolves, Coyotes and more! Look for bears, wolves, and other wildlife Rates Morning Full Day Tour (1-4 people | 8 Hours) - Additional Person - Evening Half Day Tour (1-4 people | 4 Hours) - Additional Person - if vehicle provided by guide for full or half day (6 person capacity) Duration 4 Hours (Half Day) 8 Hours (Full Day) About You may choose to tour for Yellowstone's Wildlife in the morning for the operator's Full Day Tour or in the late afternoon for the operator's Evening Tour. Generally, the operator's time with guests can start looking for bears, wolves, and other wildlife in the Hayden and Lamar Valley or one of the other great viewing areas Yellowstone has to offer.",
