  "/destinations/wyoming/cody/tours/beartooth-highway-loop-adv-bike-rental-630235": {
    "description": "Beartooth Highway | Loop + ADV Bike Rental is a locally operated experience in Cody. 6 Hours · Guided ADV Rides · Bike Rental Included - Limited Gear is available. This thrilling 6-hour loop takes riders from Cody, WY, over the legendary Beartooth Highway, one of the most iconic high-altitude roads in the U. , climbing to nearly 11,000 feet with jaw-dropping switchbacks and panoramic views.",
    "headline": "6 Hours  ·  Guided ADV Rides  ·  Bike Rental Included - Limited Gear is available",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/5O2lGev0SSK3nlF2kLzN",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Z8WF8QxlSNO8Iaz4E1Nw",
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cFapuAu4RG2QAbCLwYQZ"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "This thrilling 6-hour loop takes riders from Cody, WY, over the legendary Beartooth Highway, one of the most iconic high-altitude roads in the U",
      ", climbing to nearly 11,000 feet with jaw-dropping switchbacks and panoramic views",
      "The route descends close to the charming town of Red Lodge, MT, where the operator will stop for lunch",
      "Riders can take a break before more scenic areas that will include dirt /gravel roads at times as we head down back to Cody"
    ]
  },
