      "We recommend all members of the guest's group be present for this course and children be at least 12 years old",
      "The half day ground school focuses on foundational skills needed to descend introductory canyons",
      "Courses typically spend two hours receiving instruction at Zion Adventures™, then transition to practicing these skills at a nearby site"
