      "The course focuses on foundational skills needed to descend beginner to intermediate canyons",
      "Courses typically spend two hours receiving instruction at Zion Adventures™, then transition to practicing these skills at a nearby slot canyon",
      "The operator's instructors adhere to a comprehensive curriculum, but also have the freedom to expand on it as you are interested"
