    "description": "E-Bike Rental is a locally operated experience in Springdale. The experience includes a smooth, powerful and silent pedal-assist e-bike ideal for climbing canyon roads or cruising around town. Specialized® e-bikes offer comfortable geometry, award-winning technology and a natural-feeling ride thanks to wide tires and an ergonomic seat. The electric assist extends the guest's range so guests can confidently explore Zion Adventures® and nearby trails with less effort while carrying essentials in the included basket.",
