    "description": "Half Day Zion Hiking Tour is a locally operated experience in Springdale. Half-day guided hikes in Zion National Park exploring popular trails with knowledgeable local guides. Join Zion Adventures for a half-day hiking experience in Zion National Park led by professional local guides who share insights on geology, ecology, and human history. Trails are chosen based on group ability and season, with common routes including Watchman, Emerald Pools, Weeping Rock, Riverside Walk, and the West Rim Trail to Scout's Lookout.",
