    "description": "Technical Canyon Drysuit Package is a locally operated experience in Springdale. Begin by selecting which date and time you'd like to rent the guest's items. Recommended for cooler weather canyon descents or for descending canyons with prolonged exposure to cold water, the operator's technical drysuit package provides canyoneers a means to keep exploring in cold conditions. Zion Adventures™️ cannot guarantee the effectiveness of the operator's rental suits and strongly recommends testing the guest's suit prior to committing to a canyon descent.",
