    "description": "Full Day Slot Canyon Tour is a locally operated experience in Springdale. Ages 12+ · 8 Hours. Guests experience sculpted sandstone walls and inspiring vistas while traversing this unique desert landscape. The guest's day will include rappelling, hiking, scrambling, down climbing, and possibly wading through canyon pools.",
