    "description": "High Adventure Slot Canyon Tour is a locally operated experience in Springdale. Ages 16+ · 10 Hours · Strenuous. This experience features a challenging, rewarding, and inspiring day exploring Southern Utah's slot canyons. Guests can hike through desert terrain, rappel through beautifully sculpted sandstone walls, and possibly swim through deep pools.",
