    "description": "Rock & Canyon Guided Tour is a locally operated experience in Springdale. Combine both rock climbing and canyoneering into one action packed day. This day provides the opportunity of experiencing Zion's unique desert environment through two of its most sought after activities. Half of the guest's day will entail scaling cliffs with climbs that vary between 40 to 100 feet tall.",
