  "/destinations/utah/springdale/tours/2-day-narrows-dry-suit-package-666026": {
    "description": "2 Day: Narrows Dry-Suit Package is a locally operated experience in Springdale. 2 Day Rental · Top Down Narrows. The operator's seasonal rental packages, combined with informative Narrows Orientation provides you with up-to-date conditions so that guests can enjoy this world-renowned hike safely and comfortably. Zion Adventures™ is proud to be the pioneer of Zion Narrows Outfitting; custom designing equipment so that anyone can hike the Narrows at any time of year.",
    "headline": "2 Day Rental  ·  Top Down Narrows",
    "images": [
      "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/3Q9aPQ5dQgejRInqT1ht"
    ],
    "highlights": [
      "Includes Kokatat Gortex drysuit (sizes from youth to XXL) Canyon boots (sizes range from youth 13 to men's 14) Neoprene socks Hiking pole Map Narrows orientation",
      "Over the years, we have designed, tested and improved the canyon shoes and drysuits that have become the standard in Narrows hiking equipment",
      "Having the right equipment can make or break the guest's day",
      "Recommended equipment is based on water and air temperatures, which vary with the changing seasons",
      "During winter, having a drysuit, thick neoprene socks, quick-drying boots, and a hiking pole is essential"
    ],
    "included": [
      "Kokatat Gortex drysuit (sizes from youth to XXL) Canyon boots (sizes range from youth 13 to men's 14) Neoprene socks Hiking pole Map Narrows orientation"
    ]
  },
